  <book code="REV" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:34:43 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Revelation</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bha-aar Pakah Đóng Lêi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Pakah Đóng Lêi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rev</para>
  <para style="mt">Pakah Đóng Lêi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Rau tapakah ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đu Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq Ađó buôn chaleq đóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq Ađó nôôq rau phaai avaaih tơk kơi đâh bhlơng. Ađó ơi pakah, lơh xók n'nal tââq dhơn pleng ưng Ađó pagơơi tơk leq Jang, dhơn ratơơq ưng Ađó, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />nek manưih ơi truuih đuui leq paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng lơq paraaq truuih ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek dyóp rau ađó ơi lêi xâng. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Phươk đóng manưih đok lơq manưih xâng nôôq paraaq ưng bha-aar manưih đââng taruuih ađô, dhơ kơi ađek huuiq jư nôôq rau ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng ađek, taai tangêi kaxe đan aq.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Jang pagơơi đóng tapól Kabhuh Akóón Dhơn Chuôq dhiq xưưq A-si: Rââm adhi anó bâân ơơn phươk liêm palơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang ađôk ve, ơi ve, lơq dyơq tơk, kung kơi tââq tapól yaang toom tanơơt ưng Ađó, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />lơq tââq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek Manưih Truuih Kah Tadhơ, Yaang n'niên laloom tââm tââq akan chêt, lơq Yaang kadhâng koq nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk. Malóóm leq Yaang nh'nhơr nôôq he, ơi jóói paloh nôôq he tââq matu lơt ưng nôôq he tââq haam Ađó, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />lơq Ađó ơi têêng nôôq he vaaih mưi katiêk, xar kơi nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih đóng Yaang Pleng, Ama ưng Ađó, nhan cha-iil tabah lơq mataai raman chô leq Ađó patơk nh'chró. A-meen!<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Lêi tôôh, Ađó bhral kung palơq nôôq garboq dhaluk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">lơq dyóp mat e chaling lêi Ađó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">tabhơt lơq nôôq đu ơi tak Ađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">hayơq dyóp dhanuôr manưih dhiq katiêk e kalau nhiim ơi taai Ađó.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 1:7">Dhalam kơi achêk, A-meen!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng praaq: “Aku nek An-pha lơq Ô-mê-ga, Yaang ađôk ve, ơi ve, lơq dyơq bhral, Yaang Bhơt Mataai Têêng Koq.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Aku nek Jang, manưih adhi anó lơq manưih ting paak blah palơq adhi anó leq rau hadhơơp jarnah, katiêk karuung, lơq rau jarnah xarngaat đơơp jruôn kalóóng Chuôq Jê-su, aku tơơt dhiq m'beq kôông bâân đóók nek Baat-mô ơi taai paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng lơq paraaq taruuih ưng Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mót tangêi ưng Chuôq, aku tơơt kalóóng Yaang Liêm, lơq aku xâng hót hóng ađêi mưi dhariêng praaq karơ kơi dhariêng karyóól, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />kơi ađô: “Phaai xaraq leq panuôl bha-aar nôôq rau akóón lêi lơq pagơơi tơk tapól kabhuh Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, đóng Ê-phê-sô, Si-miêk-nơ, Beet-gam, Thi-a-ti-rơ, Saat-đe, Phi-la-đeen-phi, lơq Laau-đi-xê.” <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Aku palâh lóóiq buôn lêi dhariêng đu biêh dyơq praaq palơq ađêi, hayơq xong xók palâh lóóiq, aku chalaang lêi tapól dyung dhơu palơq vaang, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />lơq tơơt dhiq m'pơng nôôq dyung dhơu ve Yaang thê kơi Akóón Manưih, xơp aau yaal tơk dyung, kung palơq mưi beq xaneet palơq vaang bâân xeet dhiq tadhưa. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Akoq lơq xok ưng Ađó nek bhóók pakơi xok trưưu, bhóók kơi dhaluk ng'koq, mat Ađó hayơq nek thê par-aang óih, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />dyung Ađó pakơi kóng tabah chalóng, kơi ơi bâân tôk bơt kalóóng bóng óih, dhariêng Ađó thê kơi dhariêng ưng bơk jarhu đơơk, <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />ve tapól beq chatur dhiq têi atươm ưng Ađó, lơq mưi pala bhươt bơơr pla xaan lơp gluh tââq bóóp Ađó, dyơq mat Ađó nek kơi mat tangêi cha-iil chadhóng xók ađó klaaq brương bhơt brương. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Xók aku lêi Ađó, aku tampoh dhiq dyung Ađó kơi manưih chêt, hayơq Ađó kadhâng têi atươm ưng Ađó dhiq aku, praaq: “Óóq kapơn. Aku nek Yaang tââq tarnââp lơq tatun xariêq, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />kung nek Yaang taluôn mamông. Aku ơi đơơp chêt, lơq lêi nô, Aku mamông patơk nh'chró kah bil! Aku kadhâng kaliêng kliêng ưng akan chêt lơq bóng maraaih. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Taai kơi achêk, phaai xaraq lóóiq nôôq rau akóón ơi lêi, nôôq tarnêêng ađôk ve lơq nôôq rau ravang vaaih tơk lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Ađôk nek kadrêi lââp ưng tapól beq chatur đu akóón ơi lêi kalóóng têi tươm ưng Aku, palơq tapól dyung dhơu vaang: Tapól beq chatur nek nôôq dhơn pleng ưng tapól kabhuh Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, lơq tapól dyung dhơu nek tapól kabhuh Akóón Dhơn Chuôq.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn Pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Ê-phê-sô kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">‘Yaang kadhâng tapól beq chatur kalóóng têi atươm Ađó, nek Yaang jađaang vôôiq dhiq m'pơng tapól dyung dhơu palơq vaang, praaq nô kơi: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“Aku n'nal nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng akóón, gleh gleeng, palơq rau jarnah xarngaat đơơp jruôn ưng akóón, Aku kung n'nal kakơi akóón kah đuôh đơơp parngau đu aak, akóón ơi klêêu nôôq đu tư móón nek sưưq-đô bơơi piđó eh rau nek kơi achêk, lơq akóón ơi bâân n'nal piđó nek galơơk chachââr; <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />akóón kung ve rau đơơp parngau, lơq ơi đơơp jarnah ơi taai dhanóók Aku hơq kah nhưh nhok. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Aku ve rau jươm akóón, ađek nek akóón ơi lơơi tabil lóóm tanhơr tââq tarnââp ưng ađêi. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Taai kơi achêk, phaai hei lóóiq ađêi ơi dhur lóóm huuiq n'đó tââq, phaai klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt lơq têêng nôôq tarnêêng tââq tarnââp. Dyơq la kah, Aku e tơk leq akóón lơq Aku e pei lơơi dyung dhơu ưng akóón tââq dham ađó — la akóón kah klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Bơơi akóón ve rau ađô, ađek nek akóón geet nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng kabhuh Ni-kô-la, nek nôôq tarnêêng đu Aku kung geet. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq. Palơq manưih đươk lơh, Aku e đóng manưih achêk cha pale gluh tââq n'lóóng đu mamông tơơt kalóóng Ba-ra-đi ưng Yaang Pleng.”’<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Si-miêk-nơ kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">‘Yaang tââq tarnââp lơq tatun xariêq, Yaang ơi đơơp chêt lơq ơi mamông lóóiq, Ađó praaq nô kơi: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />“Aku n'nal rau hadhơơp jarnah ưng akóón lơq rau ngeeo hadhơơp dhiq akóón (bơơi palâh lóóiq, akóón dyơq kavaan kabhôôq), palơq paraaq baauq uôn bhral tââq nôôq đu móón chênh piđó nek manưih Jo Thaaiq bơơi piđó eh rau, bơơi nek đong gươl ưng Sa-taan. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Óóq kapơn marau marâ palơq nôôq rau đu akóón ravang phaai jruôn. Lêi tôôh, abhưi ravang król masôôq manưih kalóóng nôôq akóón mót đong kanam lơơi đóng nôôq akóón bâân klêêu lêi, lơq nôôq akóón e đơơp jarnah xarngaat kalóóng majêt tangêi. Phaai bhơt lóóm patơk chêt, hayơq Aku e đóng leq akóón panơơng charnap ưng parmông. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq. Manưih đươk lơh e kah mơ ve bâân jarnah tââq akan chêt đu bơơr.”’<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Beet-gam kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">‘Yaang ve pala bhươt bơơr pla xaan lơp praaq nô kơi: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />“Aku n'nal dhiq akóón mamông dhiq ađek nek tanơơt ưng Sa-taan, hơq akóón ơi kadhâng tamưng dhanóók Aku, lơq kah dyiin lơơi lóóm huuiq dhiq Aku, pamơ kalóóng nôôq tangêi ưng An-ti-ba, manưih truuih ưng Aku, manưih bhơt lóóm palơq Aku, nek manưih bâân taleng chêt toom mat nôôq akóón, dhiq đu Sa-taan jaq tơơt. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Aku ve bơơr pe rau jươm akóón, achêk nek dhiq ađek, akóón ve nôôq đu pei dyuôch paraaq pachóóm ưng Ba-la-aam, nek đu ơi pachóóm Ba-laak patơơt khuk dhơl têêng n'đóih dyung toom mat akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên đóng cha ađô bhanuôih leq yaang kabhêi lơq têêng chiên taniêt tapiing. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ting kơi dharing kơi ađek, akóón kung ve nôôq đu pei dyuôch paraaq parchóóm ưng kabhuh Ni-kô-la. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Kơi ađek hơq, phaai klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt! Dyơq la kah, Aku e đâh bhlơng tơk leq akóón, lơq e tarvei tarjơl jaklâk palơq piđó palơq pala bhươt ưng bóóp Aku. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq. Palơq manưih đươk lơh, Aku e đóng leq ađó ma-na kadrêi lââp, lơq Aku e đóng leq ađó mưi kaliêng dhơl bhóók hơq dhiq kaliêng dhơl achêk, mưi dhanóók tame ơi bâân xaraq, nek dhanóók đu kah ngaai n'nal lơh tââq manưih bâân đơơp ađó.”’<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Thi-a-ti-rơ kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">‘Akóón Yaang Pleng, Yaang ve mat kơi par-aang óih lơq dyung kơi kóng tabah chalóng, praaq nô kơi: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />“Aku n'nal nôôq tarnêêng ưng akóón, lóóm tanhơr, lóóm huuiq, rau yaauq têêng, palơq lóóm mưng chaq kah tadhơ ưng akóón, lơq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng akóón tabhêêl nh'chró dyơq grơơt lơh nôôq tarnêêng xók n'loom. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Bơơi Aku ve rau ađô jươm akóón, ađek nek akóón dyơq patui đóng kamór Jê-sa-bêên, đu tư móón ađêi nek pađiil đââng taruuih, lơq ađó pachóóm pahêêl palơq galơơk chachââr nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Aku têêng lơt taniêt tapiing lơq cha ađô bhanuôih yaang kabhêi. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Aku ơi đóng ađó tangêi kaxe đóng ađó ve bâân klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt, bơơi ađó kah kiêng klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt leq rau taniêt tapiing ưng ađêi. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Phaai lêi nô! Aku e m'peq ađó bêch arươp dharââng, lơq nôôq đu kung têêng lơt tapiing taniêt palơq ađó mót rau bhrê hư gamak, la piđó kah klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt leq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađó. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Aku e m'bhiiq nôôq akóón anaaq ađó palơq kan chêt, hayơq tabhơt nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq e n'nal kơi Aku nek Yaang chamet lêi luônh lóóm, lơq Aku e đóng leq dyóp chanak kalóóng nôôq akóón mak mơ nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng nôôq akóón. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Bơơi Aku praaq palơq nôôq akóón sôôq dyơq lóóiq kalóóng nôôq manưih dhiq Thi-a-ti-rơ, la ngaai kah ting jư paraaq parchóóm achêk, hơq nek nôôq manưih kah n'nal nôôq tarnêêng lalââp dhơuq ưng Sa-taan, kơi masôôq đu đóók klóóih Aku kah tabóq n'đó ganưi haleng lââng dhiq nôôq akóón. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Dhơ kơi ađek phaai pei jư tamưng nôôq rau ađêi ve patơk n'đó xók Aku bhral.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Palơq manưih đươk lơh lơq bhiêk pei jư nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng Aku patơk tatun xariêq, hơq Aku e đóng leq manưih achêk mataai raman dhiq nôôq katiêk.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />"Manưih ađek e kadhâng koq piđó palơq mưi beq tarlââng bhaxêi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 2:27">pakơi nôôq ajraai katiêk tet ơi m'bhiiq bhriq lêêk,"<verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />kung kơi Aku ơi bâân đơơp mataai raman tââq Ama Aku, hơq Aku e đóng leq manưih ađek m'beq chatur yayóng. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq.”’<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Saat-đe kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">‘Yaang ve tapól yaang ưng Yaang Pleng lơq tapól beq chatur praaq nô kơi: “Aku n'nal nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng akóón. Akóón ve tanđôôr nek mamông, bơơi akóón nek chêt. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Phaai meh lóóm lơq têêng đóng mưng karơ nôôq rau dyơq lóóiq, hơq nek nôôq rau kanóq chêt, taai Aku kah ơi lêi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng akóón bâân m'bhraach xong toom mat Yaang Pleng ưng Aku. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Kơi achêk hơq, phaai hei lóóiq nôôq rau akóón ơi đơơp lơq ơi xâng. Phaai huuiq ting ađek hơq klôôq lóóm kanóq lơt. Dyơq la akóón kah meh n'taach, Aku e bhral kơi đu tatông, lơq akóón dhakơi e kah n'nal n'đó bhêêl Aku bhral jơl jaklâk akóón. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Dhơ kơi ađek, akóón ve nôôq manưih dhiq Saat-đe, nek nôôq manưih ơi kah têêng bóq anhuq kun aau ađêi, lơq piđó e ting vôôiq palơq Aku kalóóng kun aau bhóók, taai piđó targlap đaang. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Manưih đươk lơh e bâân xơp leq aau yaal bhóók thê kơi achêk, Aku e kah mơ ve tabil achak manưih achêk tââq Bha-aar Parmông, lơq Aku e chanót achak ưng manưih achêk toom mat Ama Aku lơq toom mat nôôq dhơn Pleng Ađó. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq.”’<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Phi-la-đeen-phi kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">‘Yaang Tabah, Yaang Alua Dhalam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">Yaang kadhâng kaliêng kliêng ưng Đa-viit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">Yaang lóng hơq kah ngaai e kađơp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">lơq kađơp hơq kah ngaai lóng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">praaq nô kơi:<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“Aku n'nal nôôq tarnêêng ưng akóón (Lêi tôôh, Aku ơi tabóq mưi palóng bhươh talóng toom mat akóón bơơi kah ngaai ve chóóm đuôh kađơp ađó), taai akóón ve m'bưưiq praan karơ, bơơi akóón ơi huuiq jư paraaq Aku, lơq kah dyiin lơơi dhanóók Aku. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Lêi anô, Aku e têêng nôôq đu mađó đong gươl ưng Sa-taan, nek nôôq đu tư móón ađêi nek manưih Jo Thaaiq bơơi eh rau kơi achêk, palâh lóóiq, piđó chapiên nek dyơq praaq chachââr — Lêi tôôh, Aku e têêng piđó kơi đóng piđó e tơk lơq chakoh tarkól dhiq hót laloom dyung akóón, lơq piđó ve chóóm n'nal kakơi Aku nh'nhơr akóón. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Taai akóón ơi jư paraaq kah tadhơ ưng Aku, hơq Aku e kung jư akóón tââq ganah klêêu lêi kanóq tơk dhiq plok hóng katiêk, đóng klêêu nôôq ngaai dyơq mamông dhiq katiêk. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Aku dyơq bhral kơi đâh bhlơng. Phaai jư tamưng rau akóón ve đóng kah ngaai ve chóóm pei bil panơơng charnap ưng akóón. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Manưih đu đươk lơh, Aku e têêng manưih achêk val xar tanól kalóóng đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng Aku. Manưih achêk e kah mơ ve gluh tââq ađek dyơq, lơq Aku e xaraq dhiq ađó dhanóók ưng Yaang Pleng Aku, achak kanóón ưng Yaang Pleng Aku (Jê-ru-sa-leem tame dhaluônh jaq tââq dhiq pleng, tââq Yaang Pleng ưng Aku), lơq dhanóók tame ưng Aku. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq.”’<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Phaai xaraq đóng dhơn pleng ưng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Laau-đi-xê, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">‘Yaang A-meen, Manưih Truuih đaang huuiq lơq alua dhalam, Tââq Tarnââp rau tavaaih ưng Yaang Pleng praaq nô kơi: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“Aku n'nal nôôq tarnêêng ưng akóón, kơi akóón kah chriêt, kung kah puih. Rââm hau akóón chriêt rabhi chriêt môôiq puih rabhi puih! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Kơi ađek nek, taai akóón xa-ơr kah puih kung kah chriêt hơq Aku kiêng kata akóón gluh tââq bóóp Aku. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Tââq akóón móón kơi ađô: "Aku karvaan, aku ơi xar vaaih xưa raai, lơq aku kah ve marau marâ kanóq kiêng," kơi ađek hơq akóón kah n'nal kơi akóón alua jarnah xarngaat, đaang nh'nhơr, ngeeo ha-ul, bhơơm kabaang lơq lalôh lalut. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Aku pachóóm akóón kơl tư tââq Aku vaang ơi bâân tôk bơt kalóóng óih đóng akóón xar vaaih kavaan kabhôôq, kơl aau yaal bhóók chadhah đóng akóón xơp bơơi kah dyơq pakah gluh rau kachiit mat taai rau lalôh lalut ưng ađêi, lơq kơl janươu chalóóng mat đóng xut mat ưng akóón buôn đóng akóón chóóm bâân lêi. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />La nôôq ngaai đu Aku nh'nhơr, hơq Aku teng trêh lơq klôôq phaak. Nek hayơq, phaai bhơt lóóm lơq klôôq lóóm karnóq lơt aq. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Lêi tôôh, Aku dyương dhiq palóng lơq takóq. La ngaai xâng dhariêng Aku lơq lóng palóng, hơq Aku e mót palơq manưih ađek, cha vaar palơq ađó, lơq ađó palơq Aku. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Manưih đu đươk lơh, Aku e đóng manưih achêk tơơt palơq Aku dhiq tanơơt Aku, kơi Aku kung ơi đươk lơh lơq tơơt palơq Ama Aku dhiq tanơơt Ađó. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Ngaai ve katór, phaai xâng paraaq Yaang Liêm praaq palơq nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq.”’”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek, aku chalaang lêi lơq tôôh mưi beq palóng bâân tarlóng dhiq pleng, hayơq dhariêng tarnââp đu aku ơi xâng praaq palơq aku kơi dhariêng karyóól, móón kơi ađô: “Phaai đơk leq ađô, hayơq Aku e chaleq đóng akóón lêi nôôq tarnêêng phaai avaaih bhral tatun nôôq tarnêêng ađô.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />N'drươh ađek nek, aku tơơt kalóóng Yaang Liêm, lơq lêi tôôh, mưi tanơơt bâân lơơi dhiq pleng, lơq ve mưi Yaang dyơq tơơt dhiq tanơơt. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt palơq lêi parliêm thê kơi ngok dhơl bhreh bhrel lơq ngok manaau, palơq nek mưi gavương mariêng xirvir praang tanơơt palơq lêi parliêm thê kơi ngok taviêng axơq n'lóóng. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Xirvir praang tanơơt ve bơơr jêt puôn beq tanơơt, lơq tơơt dhiq tanơơt nek bơơr jêt puôn takóh bhươl bâân pei xơp aau yaal bhóók, palơq panơơng charnap palơq vaang dhiq akoq piđó. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Tââq tanơơt yuur vaaih nôôq chaach kamlaaq, dhariêng grưng grưng, palơq dhariêng grơm. Tapól beq dhơu óih dyơq róh toom tanơơt, hơq nek tapól yaang ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Toom tanơơt thê kơi mưi tala xamil chadhah makơi phalê, dyơq dhiq pa-ô m'pơng tanơơt lơq xirvir praang tanơơt nek puôn panong akóón adhah, bing nôôq kaliêng mat, hót lóóm palơq hót hóng. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Akóón adhah đu tarnââp thê sư tư, akóón adhah đu bơơr thê karók akóón, akóón adhah đu pe ve moh mat kơi ưng manưih, lơq akóón adhah đu puôn thê achim kalaang adhuuk dyơq par. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Puôn panong akóón adhah dyóp panong kalóóng sôôq piđó ting panong ve chapat nanang xirvir praang, hót kalóóng bing nôôq kaliêng mat, lơq tangêi lơq hayum, piđó kah ve rau dhêi drơq xók praaq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Tabah liêm, Tabah liêm, Tabah liêm nek Chuôq, Yaang Pleng Bhơt Mataai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">Yaang ơi ve, ađôk ve lơq dyơq tơk.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />La n'đó xók nôôq akóón adhah tapôông cha-iil tabah, rau bhi chap, lơq paraaq ma-ơơn đóng Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt, nek Yaang mamông patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />nek bơơr jêt puôn takóh bhươl e chakoh takól toom mat Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt, lơq bhuôih kakoh Yaang mamông patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn, lơq piđó lơơi panơơng charnap ađêi leq toom tanơơt, praaq kơi ađô:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Kakoh Chuôq lơq Yaang Pleng nôôq yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Amei alua targlap đaang pei đơơp cha-iil tabah, rau bhi chap, lơq bhơt mataai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">taai Amei ơi tavaaih dyóp rau;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kung tââq karnóq kiêng Amei hơq piđó chaq ching lơq bâân tavaaih.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Hayơq aku lêi dhiq têi atươm ưng Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt mưi panuôl bha-aar ơi bâân xaraq hót kalóóng lơq hót nguôi, bâân let kiêr tââq tapól kanal. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Aku kung lêi mưi dhơn pleng grâ karơ, karơ dhariêng yuur papraaq: “Ngaai targlap đaang lương panuôl bha-aar lơq plók nôôq kanal let kiêr ưng ađó?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kah ngaai m'piing pleng môôiq n'raal katiêk hamôôiq hót raal katiêk ve chóóm lương panuôl bha-aar môôiq lêi leq ađó. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Kơi ađek nek aku nhiim ka-ai karuôq taai kah ngaai bâân chamet lêi nek targlap đaang đóng lương panuôl bha-aar hamôôiq đok ađó. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Hayơq mưi kalóóng nôôq takóh bhươl praaq palơq aku: “Óóq nhiim. Lêi tôôh! Sư Tư, Yaang gluh tââq kabhuh Ju-đa, Akóón Chachau ưng Đa-viit, Ađó ơi đươk lơh đóng lương panuôl bha-aar palơq tapól kanal let kiêr ưng ađó.” <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Lơq tơơt pa-ô m'pơng tanơơt palơq puôn panong akóón adhah lơq tơơt m'pơng nôôq takóh bhươl, aku lêi Trưưu Akóón dyơq dyương, kơi ơi bâân taleng, ve tapól tagê lơq tapól kaliêng mat, hơq nek tapól yaang ưng Yaang Pleng bâân kayua vôôiq plok katiêk. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ađó bhral lơq pei đơơp panuôl bha-aar tââq têi atươm ưng Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Xók Ađó ơi pei đơơp panuôl bha-aar, puôn panong akóón adhah lơq bơơr jêt puôn takóh bhươl chakoh tarkól leq katiêk toom mat Trưưu Akóón, ting chanak ve mưi beq tambhreh haak lơq mưi beq jahương palơq vaang kađôôq bing dhaak, hơq nek nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng nôôq manưih huuiq. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Piđó babóóch mưi guôp bhanóóch tame, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Ađó targlap đaang pei đơơp panuôl bha-aar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">lơq lương nôôq kanal let kiêr ưng ađó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Taai Ađó ơi bâân taleng lơq tââq haam ađêi Ađó kơl chô đóng Yaang Pleng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nôôq manưih tââq dyóp dhong nooi, dhariêng paraaq, dhanuôr manưih lơq katiêk karuung.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Ađó ơi têêng piđó val vaaih mưi katiêk karuung lơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih đóng Yaang Pleng nôôq he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">lơq piđó e kadhâng akoq dhiq katiêk.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Hayơq aku chalaang lêi lơq xâng dhariêng ưng bơk dhơn pleng xirvir praang tanơơt kung palơq nôôq akóón adhah lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, hơq tabhơt nôôq ưng piđó nek kaaq ngaan kaaq-bhaan, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />mandrươh yuur praaq karơ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">“Trưưu Akóón ơi bâân taleng, alua nek targlap đaang đóng pei đơơp mataai raman,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">kavaan kabhôôq, tabech galang, praan karơ, bhi chap, cha-iil tabah, lơq babóóch haanh.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Hayơq aku xâng dyóp rau tavaaih m'piing pleng, n'raal katiêk, hót n'raal katiêk, dhiq taxiiq, lơq dyóp rau kalóóng piđó, praaq kơi ađô: “Nhan đóng Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt lơq Trưưu Akóón bâân babóóch haanh, bhi chap, cha-iil tabah, lơq têêng kala patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Puôn panong akóón adhah praaq: “A-meen!” dyơq nôôq takóh bhươl chakoh takól leq katiêk lơq bhuôih kakoh.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Hayơq aku chalaang lêi xók Trưưu Akóón plók mưi kalóóng tapól kanal let kiêr, lơq aku xâng mưi kalóóng puôn panong akóón adhah praaq kơi dhariêng grơm kaglư, kơi ađô: “Phaai bhral!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Kơi ađek nek, aku chalaang lêi lơq tôôh mưi panong axeh bhóók! Manưih dhââng m'piing axeh achêk ve mưi beq panenh, lơq bâân đóng mưi panơơng charnap leq ađó, hayơq manưih achêk gluh đuôh jeng đóng đươk lơh.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu bơơr, aku xâng akóón adhah đu bơơr yua: “Phaai bhral!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Kơi ađek nek mưi panong axeh lââng tabhral, parhóm bhrôông kơi óih. Palơq manưih dhââng m'piing axeh ađô nek ơi bâân đóng leq ađêi kataai pei lơơi khe liêm tââq katiêk, đóng palââng e tartak tarleng xóng ađêi, lơq mưi pala bhươt lóng gamak ơi bâân đóng leq manưih achêk.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu pe, Aku xâng panong akóón adhah đu pe praaq: “Phaai bhral!” Kơi ađek nek aku chalaang lêi lơq tôôh, mưi panong axeh tam, lơq manưih dhââng m'piing axeh ađô ve mưi beq kanơng dhiq têi ađêi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Hayơq aku xâng kơi ve dhariêng dhiq m'pơng puôn panong akóón adhah, kơi ađô: “Mưi arê aviq mi palơq mưi đơ-ni-ê; pe arê aviq met palơq mưi đơ-ni-ê. Lơq óóq têêng ramuôh pahư dhơu lơq buôh.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu puôn, aku xâng dhariêng ưng akóón adhah đu puôn praaq: “Phaai bhral!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Kơi ađek nek aku chalaang lêi lơq tôôh, mưi panong axeh taviêng mlaang. Manưih dhââng m'piing axeh ađô chak ađó nek “Akan Chêt”, lơq bóng maraaih ting vôôiq tapun hóng ađó. Mataai Raman dhiq m'piing mưi phơn puôn mat katiêk ơi bâân đóng leq piđó, đóng leng đet palơq bhươt chabhaam, ha-ul kró, ka-ai parluh, lơq tââq nôôq adhah booiq dhiq katiêk.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu xââng, aku lêi karum baang bhanuôih ravaai ưng nôôq manưih ơi bâân taleng taai paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng lơq taai paraaq truuih đu piđó ơi jư. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Piđó mandrươh dhariêng dhaloong karơ kơi ađô: “Kakoh Yaang Kala Bhơt, Yaang tabah liêm lơq dhalam lalua, patơk n'đó bhêêl đu Amei biêh kah ơi xêi lơt lơq chróót bharang đóng ahaam ưng nôôq akóón tââq nôôq đu dyơq mamông dhiq katiêk?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Hayơq ting chanak kalóóng piđó bâân đóng mưi aau yaal bhóók, lơq piđó bâân kayua kơi piđó biêh kơng đương lêi m'bưưiq đươnh dyơq patơk xók bâân dyóp sôôq nôôq parjơơk marau tarnêêng ưng piđó lơq nôôq adhi anó ưng piđó nek nôôq manưih ravang bâân taleng chêt, kung thê kơi piđó.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu chapat, aku yaam lêi lơq ve mưi dharơp dha-ơr katiêk gamak, hayơq mat tangêi vaaih xar kanam kanheet kơi aau bhaai ramaanh palơq xok adhah, dyơq tabhơt mat bharương nek val xar thê kơi ahaam, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />lơq nôôq chatur xamenh dhiq pleng n'tôq leq katiêk, dhiêp kơi n'lóóng tarung rung pale taviêng ưng ađó xók bâân adhiiq gamak ng'kơr ganhưk. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Talaang pleng bil tich kơi mưi panuôl bha-aar bâân tapuôl lóóiq lơq dyóp bôôl kakóóng palơq kôông taxiiq maar bâân patââi tââq dham ưng piđó. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Hayơq nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk palơq nôôq kuôn gamak, nôôq takóh linh, kabhuh đong karvaan, kabhuh têêng kala, lơq dyóp manưih têêng xól lơq manưih rathaai, maar kadrêi ađêi klôôn kalóóng nôôq gơơp bóng lơq dhiq m'pơng nôôq bhangôh dhơl dhiq nôôq bôôl kakóóng; <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />piđó móón palơq nôôq bôôl kakóóng lơq nôôq bhangôh dhơl: “Phaai hakơh leq m'piing nôôq yi lơq kadrêi palââp nôôq yi tââq mat ưng Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt lơq tââq ganơt pagrâ jar-ââih ưng Trưưu Akóón, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />taai tangêi garâ ja-ââih gamak ưng nôôq Yaang achêk ơi bhral, hơq ngaai ve chóóm đuôh jruôn?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Lơh tarnêêng ađek, aku lêi puôn dhơn pleng dyương dhiq puôn n'tól katiêk, jư tamưng puôn paloong adhiiq ưng katiêk đóng adhiiq óóq pruung dhiq katiêk, hamôôiq dhiq taxiiq, môôiq dhiq dhađó n'lóóng ng'kuông. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi dhơn pleng lââng yuur bhral tââq charhóóng mat tangêi blo, dyơq kadhâng kanal ưng Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông. Ađó karơ dhariêng dhaloong puôn chanak dhơn pleng, nek nôôq chanak đu mataai raman ơi bâân đóng leq piđó đóng têêng pahư katiêk lơq taxiiq, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />kơi ađô: “Óóq têêng pahư katiêk, môôiq taxiiq, hamôôiq n'lóóng ng'kuông, patơk xók nôôq he ơi ve chóóm tabóq kanal nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng nôôq he bóq dhiq maang ưng piđó.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Aku xâng sôôq manưih bâân tabóq kanal nek mưi hariêng puôn jêt puôn ngaan, nek nôôq manưih bâân tabóq kanal tư tââq dyóp kabhuh akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên:<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />tââq kabhuh Ju-đa, majêt bơơr ngaan manưih ơi bâân tabóq kanal;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">tââq kabhuh Ru-bêên, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">tââq kabhuh Gaat, majêt bơơr ngaan;<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />tââq kabhuh A-se, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">tââq kabhuh Neep-ta-li, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">tââq kabhuh Ma-na-se, majêt bơơr ngaan;<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />tââq kabhuh Si-mê-ôôn, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">tââq kabhuh Lê-vi, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">tââq kabhuh I-sa-ka, majêt bơơr ngaan;<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />tââq kabhuh Sa-bu-lôôn, majêt bơơr ngaan;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">tââq kabhuh Jô-seep, majêt bơơr ngaan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">tââq kabhuh Bêên-ja-miin, majêt bơơr ngaan manưih ơi bâân tabóq kanal.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek, aku chalaang lêi, lơq tôôh, mưi tanóói manưih ganơr bơk bơơi kah ngaai ve chóóm yaap đuôh tanóói ganơr achêk, bhral tââq dyóp katiêk, nôôq dhong nooi, nôôq dhanuôr, lơq dhariêng paraaq, dyơq dyương toom tanơơt lơq toom Trưưu Akóón, xók bâân xơp aau yaal bhóók, lơq nôôq đóóng tââm chalón kalóóng têi piđó, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />hayơq piđó lalơu karơ dhariêng, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:10">“Rau paq jóói mađó lơq Yaang Pleng nôôq he, Yaang dyơq jaq dhiq tanơơt, lơq mađó lơq Trưưu Akóón!”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Kơi ađek nek tabhơt dhơn pleng dyơq dyương praang tanơơt palơq nôôq takóh bhươl lơq puôn panong akóón adhah maar chip mat ađêi leq toom tanơơt hơq bhuôih kakoh Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />ââi:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:12">“A-meen! Rau babóóch haanh, cha-iil tabah, tabech galang, ma-ơơn, bhi chap mataai karơ, palơq praan karơ maar chô leq Yaang Pleng nôôq he patơk nh'chró taluôn luôn A-meen.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Hayơq mưi kalóóng nôôq takóh bhươl pơơh paraaq palơq aku, kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih bâân xơp aau yaal bhóók tôôh piđó nek ngaai, lơq piđó n'tââq bhral?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Aku móón palơq ađó: “Chuôq aku ơơi, Amei n'nal aq.” Hayơq, ađó achêk praaq palơq aku: “Ađôk nek nôôq manưih ơi bhral tââq Ganơt Bơk Jarnah, piđó ơi pươh aau yaal ađêi, lơq têêng piđó xar bhóók kalóóng ahaam Trưưu Akóón.<verse eid="REV 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ơi taai rau ađôk, piđó bâân tơơt toom tanơơt Yaang Pleng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">tangêi hayum bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng kalóóng đong Ađó.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">Lơq Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt e têêng pơơq dhiq m'piing piđó.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Piđó e kah xâng ha-ul dyơq, kung e kah xâng rahaal dyơq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">mat tangêi hamôôiq dhơ ganah huôl puih dhađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">e kah mơ chóóm boh róh piđó,<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />taai Trưưu Akóón, Yaang tơơt pa-ô m'pơng tanơơt, e ban jư piđó;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Ađó e chơơng đââng piđó tơk tóm đơơk parmông,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:17">lơq Yaang Pleng e dyuut góh bhơt dyóp đơơk mat tââq mat piđó.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Xók Trưưu Akóón plók kanal let kiêr đu tapól, ve rau parngau bha-ip dhiq pleng kalóóng mơ m'pơng tangêi. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Hayơq aku lêi tapól chanak dhơn pleng, đu piđó dyương toom mat Yaang Pleng, lơq tapól beq karyóól bâân pađơơp đóng piđó.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Mưi dhơn pleng lââng tơk, kadhâng manoh dhaak palơq vaang, dyương dhiq baang bhanuôih, lơq bơk dhaak bâân đóng leq dhơn pleng achêk đóng ve chóóm tapôông mandrươh palơq nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng dyóp ngaai manưih huuiq dhiq baang bhanuôih palơq vaang dhiq toom tanơơt. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Gayươk dhaak, kung palơq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng nôôq manưih đu huuiq, tââq têi chanak dhơn pleng yuur par toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Dhơn pleng pei manoh dhaak, lơq buur bing ađó palơq óih ưng baang bhanuôih, hayơq m'peq leq katiêk, nek ve nôôq dhariêng grơm dha-ơr, dhariêng grưng grưng, kamlaaq xablach, palơq dha-ơr katiêk.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Hayơq tapól dhơn pleng ve tapól beq karyóól ravang paróóng chênh ađêi đóng piđó ve chóóm plong.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Dhơn pleng đu tarnââp plong karyóól, nek ve bó dhơl lơq óih taluk palơq ahaam n'toh leq katiêk, hayơq mưi phơn pe katiêk bâân róh sek, mưi phơn pe n'lóóng póóih bâân róh lưch, lơq tabhơt bhơơi taviêng bâân róh lưch.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Dhơn pleng đu bơơr plong karyóól, nek rauriq ađek thê kơi libêêq kakóóng gamak róh garưq kalóóng óih bâân m'peq leq taxiiq, hayơq mưi phơn pe ưng taxiiq vaaih xar ahaam, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />mưi phơn pe akóón adhah ve parmông kalóóng taxiiq maar chêt, lơq mưi phơn pe bhuông galaai bâân geh pahư.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Hayơq dhơn pleng đu pe plong karyóól, nek mưi beq chatur gamak bhlơng, róh garưq kơi par-aang dharương, n'tôq tââq têêh pleng, lơq ađó n'tôq leq dhiq mưi phơn pe karuung bhaxiing lơq dhiq tóm đơơk. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Achak ưng m'beq chatur ađek bâân đóók nek Janươu Atang. Mưi phơn pe nôôq parloong đơơk vaaih xar janươu atang, lơq bơk manưih chêt taai tââq đơơk ađô taai piđó ơi vaaih xar atang.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Hayơq dhơn pleng đu puôn plong karyóól, hơq mưi phơn pe mat tangêi bâân tam bhiiq, kung palơq mưi phơn pe mat bharương lơq mưi phơn pe sôôq chatur xamenh, buôn đóng mưi phơn pe ưng piđó bâân kanam kajeem, hơq m'pơng tangêi palơq mưi phơn pe ưng ađó kah ve taklaaq brương, lơq m'pơng hayum kung kơi achêk.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Hayơq aku lêi, lơq aku xâng mưi panong achim kalaang adhuuk dyơq par dhiq m'pơng pleng yuur xuul karơ dhariêng: “Ayô xarngaat, ayô xarngaat, ayô xarngaat đóng nôôq đu mamông n'raal katiêk, xók biêh dyơq nôôq dhariêng karyóól ưng pe chanak dhơn pleng ravang yuur plong.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Hayơq dhơn pleng đu xââng plong karyóól, nek aku lêi mưi beq chatur tââq pleng ơi n'tôq leq katiêk, lơq kaliêng kliêng bóng dhơuq ưng bóng luôh luông ơi bâân đóng leq ađó. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ađó lóng bóng dhơuq gluh ưng bóng luôh luông, nek gayươk tââq bóng dhơuq yuur par kơi gayươk ưng mưi bóng óih gamak, lơq mat tangêi palơq parhââm maar bâân kanam lóóiq taai tââq gayươk ưng bóng dhơuq ađô. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Hayơq tââq gayươk ađek vaaih bhral kabhuh maniit amaach dhiq katiêk, lơq kataai karơ bâân đóng leq piđó thê kơi kataai karơ m'ma agót ve dhiq katiêk. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Rau bâân kayua đóng piđó ađek nek piđó kah phaaq pahư bhơơi dhiq katiêk môôiq dhơ dharau bhơơi nhơk hamôôiq n'lóóng m'póóih n'đó, bơơi chapiên têêng pahư akóón manưih, nek nôôq đu kah ve kanal ưng Yaang Pleng dhiq maang ađêi. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Tarnêêng bâân pajaau đóng piđó ađek nek piđó kah chóóm leng chêt palââng, dhơ kơi ađek piđó e bâân janah chanaaq kalóóng xââng kaxe, lơq ganơt janah chanaaq dhiq piđó kơi rau janah chanaaq tââq akóón agót xók ađó kap akóón manưih. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, akóón manưih e tabâân karchêt, bơơi piđó dhơ dhakơi e kah bâân lum ađó, lơq piđó e rââm kiêng bâân chêt, bơơi akan chêt nek róch changaai tââq piđó. <verse eid="REV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Dyaang achak ưng kabhuh amiit amaach thê kơi axeh ravang ravưa gluh tarjơl. Dhiq akoq piđó nek rau ađek thê panơơng charnap pakơi rau palơq vaang, hayơq mat piđó nek thê mat manưih. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Piđó ve xok kơi xok pađiil parkan, lơq kaniêng piđó nek thê kơi ưng sư tư. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Piđó ve gróh pađơp tadhưa dhiêp kơi gróh palơq bhaxêi, lơq dhariêng nanang ưng piđó thê kơi dhariêng ưng nôôq xe axeh tarjơl, ưng bơk panong axeh xók ruul leq dhiq tarjơl. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Piđó ve xóói palơq chapââr xóch makơi akóón agót, lơq praan karơ ưng piđó kalóóng nôôq xóói ađêi buôn têêng pahư akóón manưih kalóóng xââng kaxe. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Piđó ve bhua dhiq piing ađêi nek abhưi môôp ưng bóng luôh luông. Achak ađó kalóóng dhariêng Hi-baaq-laai nek A-ba-đôôn, dyơq kalóóng dhariêng Hi-laap, ađó ve achak nek A-bô-li-ôôn.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Rau jarnah xarngaat đu tarnââp ơi lơh. Lêi tôôh, biêh dyơq bơơr rau jarnah xarngaat dyơq bhral dyơq tatun nôôq tarnêêng ađô.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Hayơq dhơn pleng đu chapat plong karyóól, lơq aku xâng mưi dhariêng praaq gluh tââq nôôq tagê ưng baang bhuôih palơq vaang dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />kayua đóng dhơn pleng đu chapat, nek chanak dyơq ve m'beq karyóól: “Phaai paloh puôn dhơn pleng biêh bâân taklooiq dhiq karuung gamak Ơ-phơ-raat.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Kơi ađek nek, puôn dhơn pleng, nek nôôq chanak ơi bâân ravang lơơi xók chênh xók, tangêi, kaxe, kamó ađek, bâân gluh paloh buôn đóng piđó ve chóóm leng chêt mưi phơn pe akóón manưih. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Sôôq linh dhââng axeh nek bơơr hariêng triêuq. Aku ơi xâng parbơk ưng piđó kơi ađek. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Lơq kalóóng pakah lêi, aku ơi lêi kabhuh axeh lơq nôôq đu dhââng dhiq piđó pakơi ađô ve gróh pađơp tadhưa bhrôông ngót, lơq parhóm taviêng ngót, lơq parhóm rââk ưng lưưu hunh. Akoq nôôq akóón axeh ađô nek thê kơi akoq sư tư, tââq bóóp piđó próih pagluh óih, gayươk lơq lưưu hunh. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Mưi phơn pe akóón manưih bâân taleng chêt taai tââq pe bhrê hư ađô, tââq óih, gayươk, lơq lưưu hunh próih gluh tââq bóóp piđó. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Tââq praan karơ ưng kabhuh axeh nek tââq bóóp piđó lơq dhiq xóói piđó, taai xóói piđó pakơi xóói kaxênh ve akoq, lơq tââq ađek piđó têêng tabhrê akóón manưih. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Phơn dyơq lóóiq ưng akóón manưih, nek nôôq đu yươq ơi bâân leng chêt tââq nôôq bhrê hư ađô, ơi kah klôôq karnóq lóóm lơt leq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng têi ađêi, buôn đóng piđó e kah bhuôih kakoh abhưi palơq nôôq yaang kabhêi palơq vaang, baak, kóng, dhơl, lơq n'lóóng, nek nôôq rau kah ve chóóm lalêi, hamôôiq tameng xâng, môôiq vôôiq veq. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Piđó kung kah klôôq lóóm karnóq lơt leq nôôq matu leng manưih, têêng abhô, têêng tapiing kah paprô, môôiq tatông papei ưng ađêi.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Dharing ađek, aku lêi mưi dhơn Pleng grâ karơ lââng tââq têêh pleng dhaluônh, bâân ng'guôk leq mưi garboq dhaluk, palơq gavương mariêng dhiq akoq ađêi, mat dhơn pleng achêk kơi mat tangêi, dyung ưng ađó achêk nek kơi chruônh óih, <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />lơq dyơq jư mưi panuôl bha-aar ng'kar katưưiq ơi talương kalóóng têi ađêi. Dhơn pleng achêk đâq dyung atươm ađêi dhiq taxiiq dyơq dyung ađaai dhiq kakóóng, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />hayơq yuur treeh mưi dhariêng karơ thê kơi sư tư gahuum. Xók dhơn pleng achêk treeh karơ, nek tapól dhariêng grơm yuur tar-auq palơq nôôq dhariêng praaq ưng piđó. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Xók tapól dhariêng grơm yuur xuul, aku kanóq xaraq lóóiq, nek aku xâng mưi dhariêng móón tââq pleng praaq: “Phaai tabóq karnal let kiêr nôôq rau tapól dhariêng grơm ơi praaq, hơq óóq xaraq piđó lóóiq.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Hayơq dhơn pleng đu aku lêi dyương dhiq taxiiq lơq dhiq kakóóng, jarơ têi atươm ađêi leq pleng <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />lơq ng'kóh tââq dhanóók Yaang mamông patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn, nek Yaang ơi tavaaih pleng palơq dyóp rau dhiq pleng, katiêk palơq dyóp rau dhiq katiêk, lơq taxiiq palơq dyóp rau kalóóng taxiiq, kơi ađô: “E kah dyơq pađươnh dyơq. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Bơơi mót nôôq tangêi ve dhariêng ưng dhơn pleng đu tapól, xók ađó achêk ravang plong karyóól, nek kadrêi palââp ưng Yaang Pleng e bâân vaaih chaq, dhiêp kơi Ađó ơi truuih taruuih huuiq marhaal achêk đóng dhơn ratơơq Ađó nek nôôq manưih đââng taruuih.” <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Hayơq dhariêng đu aku xâng tââq pleng val praaq palơq aku, kơi ađô: “Phaai vôôiq, pei panuôl bha-aar ng'kar ơi lương lơơi kalóóng têi ưng dhơn pleng dyơq dyương dhiq taxiiq lơq dhiq kakóóng.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Kơi ađek nek aku tơk paleq dhơn pleng ađek, móón ađó achêk đóng leq aku panuôl bha-aar ng'kar katưưiq. Dhơn pleng achêk kayua aku: “Phaai pei đơơp lơq cha ađó vaq, hayơq ađó e têêng luônh amei bâân atang, bơơi kalóóng bóóp amei, ađó e baq kơi đơơk gayơơiq.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Aku pei đơơp panuôl bha-aar ng'kar katưưiq tââq têi ưng dhơn pleng lơq cha ađó, ađó tơơt kalóóng bóóp aku baq kơi đơơk gayơơiq, bơơi xók aku ơi cha ađó, luônh aku bâân atang. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Hayơq bơk dhariêng praaq palơq aku: “Amei kơng phaai praaq loom taruuih machu dyơq leq bơk dhanuôr, bơk katiêk, nôôq dhariêng paraaq, lơq bhua chuôq.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Dha ring ađek, mưi n'dreh karbho makơi m'beq dhanang đang ơi bâân pađơơp leq aku, xók ve dhariêng praaq: “Phaai yuur dyương lơq đang đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng palơq baang bhanuôih, palơq nôôq manưih bhuôih kakoh kalóóng ađek. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Dyơq leq taang, nek phơn hót nguôi đong bhanuôih, phaai châng lơơi, óóq đang ađó, taai ađó ơi bâân pajaau leq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng lơq piđó e đâq grơl kanóón liêm kalóóng puôn jêt bơơr kaxe. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Hayơq Aku e patơơt lơơi bơơr manưih truuih taruuih ưng Aku, lơq piđó e praaq loom taruuih kalóóng mưi ngaan bơơr hariêng chapat jêt tangêi, xók biêh xơp aau bhaai ramaanh.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Bơơr manưih truuih ađô nek bơơr tââm ô liiu lơq bơơr dyung dhơu dyương toom mat Chuôq ưng katiêk. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />La ngaai kanóq têêng mahaai nhiđó, hơq óih vaaih gluh tââq bóóp nhiđó hayơq óch róh nôôq têêng brau ađêi, hơq la ngaai manưih kiêng tabhrê pahư nhiđó, nek manưih achêk phaai bâân taleng chêt kơi achêk. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Nhiđó ve kataai kađơp pleng lóóiq đóng kah ve bó ruuh leq katiêk kalóóng nôôq tangêi ting paraaq loom truuih ưng nhiđó, lơq nhiđó ve kataai dhiq nôôq jarhu đơơk đóng tavaaih piđó xar ahaam lơq đóng janah pahư katiêk palơq dyóp rau bhrê hư, leq dhơ n'đó bhêêl nhiđó kiêng. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Xók nhiđó ơi xong bhơt paraaq taruuih ưng nhiđêi, nek akóón adhah yuur đơk tââq bóng luôh luông e tavaaih tarjeng tarjơl palơq nhiđó, lơq ađó e đươk lơh nhiđó hayơq leng nhiđó vaq. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Xaak ưng nhiđó e bêch dhiq kalơng bhươh ưng kanóón gamak (nek kanóón bâân đóók kiêng móón nek Sô-đôôm lơq Ai Kơp), nek kung dhiq đu Chuôq ưng nhiđó ơi bâân tateeng đinh dhiq baang chatông. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kalóóng pe tangêi m'pơng, manưih tââq plok nôôq dhanuôr, nôôq dhong nooi, nôôq dhariêng paraaq lơq nôôq katiêk kruung maar lêi xaak ưng nhiđó lơq palââng kah đóng pheep nôôq xaak ưng nhiđó bâân tơp kalóóng ping. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk bhuui sương leq nhiđó lơq cha đah marhaal, piđó e pagơơi kaliim xóng ađêi taai bơơr nak loom đââng taruuih ađek ơi têêng đóng dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk jarnah xarngaat. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Hayơq lơh pe tangêi m'pơng, parhââm hââm parmông tââq Yaang Pleng mót leq kalóóng nhiđó, lơq nhiđó yuur dyương dhiq dyung nhiđêi, kơi ađek nek rau kakhin kapơn gamak bhlơng n'toh leq nôôq đu chalaang lêi nhiđó. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Hayơq nhiđó xâng mưi dhariêng karơ tââq pleng, praaq palơq nhiđêi: “Đơk leq ađô!” Kơi ađek nek, nhiđó đơk leq pleng kalóóng mưi garboq dhaluk, lơq nôôq têêng brau ưng nhiđó maar chaling lêi nhiđó. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Mót ganah achêk, mưi dharơp dha-ơr katiêk gamak vaaih, lơq mưi phơn majêt ưng kanóón hakơh halơm. Kalóóng dharơp dha-ơr katiêk, dhanóók ưng tapól ngaan manưih bâân chêt bil, lơq nôôq đu dyơq mamông val vaaih kakhin kapơn hơq đóng cha-iil tabah leq Yaang Pleng dhiq pleng.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Rau jarnah xarngaat đu bơơr ơi lơh. Lêi tôôh, rau jarnah xarngaat đu pe dyơq tơk kơi đâh bhlơng.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Mưi dhơn pleng đu tapól plong karyóól, nek nôôq dhariêng praaq karơ talóng gluh tââq têêh pleng, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">“Katiêk karuung ưng hóng katiêk ơi val xar katiêk karuung ưng Chuôq nôôq he lơq Yaang đơơp xut dhơu ưng Ađó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">Ađó e kadhâng akoq patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Hayơq bơơr jêt puôn takóh bhươl dyơq tơơt dhiq tanơơt ưng piđó toom mat Yaang Pleng, ơi chip mat ađêi leq katiêk lơq bhuôih kakoh Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Kakoh Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang Bhơt Mataai, Yaang đôk ve lơq ơi ve, nôôq yi ma-ơơn Amei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">taai Amei ơi kadhâng jư mataai raman gamak bhlơng ưng Amei lơq kadhâng akoq.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Nôôq katiêk yuur grâ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">bơơi ganơt pagrâ ưng Amei ơi tơk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">lơq xók ganah đóng nôôq đu chêt bâân xêi lơt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">palơq đóng chaner leq nôôq dhơn ratơơq Amei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nek nôôq manưih đââng truuih lơq nôôq manưih huuiq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">palơq nôôq manưih bhi kakhin dhanóók Amei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">manưih paniên lơq manưih taha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">lơq leng kaxiêt nôôq đu dyơq leng kaxiêt katiêk.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Hayơq đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt dhiq pleng bâân tarlóng lơơi lơq taraang raket bóóp ưng Chuôq bâân chalaang lêi kalóóng đong bhanuôih Ađó. Dharing ađek, ve nôôq chaach kamlaaq, nôôq dhariêng grưng grưng, lơq dhariêng grơm tar-auq, mưi dharơp dha-ơr katiêk palơq garnhuh bó dhơl gamak.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Hayơq mưi kanal chrih gamak bâân đơơp lêi tơơt dhiq pleng: mưi pađiil parkan ng'guôk leq achak mat tangêi, lơq mat bharương dhiq n'raal dyung ađó, palơq mưi panơơng charnap majêt bơơr beq chatur dhiq koq ađó, <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />lơq taai dyơq ve đađââng, ađó lalơu lalaang kalóóng ganhuh ka-ai ayaai, lơq xók karuôq chaliêq đóng n'niên akóón. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Lơq mưi kanal chrih lââng bâân đơơp lêi m'piing pleng: Lêi têêh, mưi kaxênh karông gamak parhóm bhrôông ve tapól akoq, majêt tagê, palơq tapól panơơng charnap dhiq nôôq akoq ưng ađó. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Xóói ưng ađó galôôi mưi phơn pe nôôq chatur xamenh dhiq pleng hayơq m'peq piđó leq katiêk. Hayơq akóón karông dyương toom manưih pađiil parkan ravang n'niên akóón, đóng xók ađó n'niên akóón nek karông e pei lâân akóón ưng ađó. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ađó n'niên mưi akóón padruuih, akóón paniên nek manưih e kadhâng akoq dyóp katiêk palơq tarlââng bhaxêi. Hayơq akóón ưng ađó bâân n'drooih pei đóng Yaang Pleng lơq patơk kakloq tanơơt Ađó, <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />dyơq manưih pađiil parkan nek mut klôôn mót leq kruung vơng, dhiq đu ađó ve mưi dham bâân Yaang Pleng ravang lơơi dhiq ađek, đóng ve nôôq manưih gamang lêi ađó tơơt dhiq ađô kalóóng mưi ngaan bơơr hariêng chapat jêt tangêi.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Hayơq ve mưi dharơp tarjơl m'piing pleng. Mi-ka-êên lơq nôôq dhơn pleng ưng manưih tarjeng tarjơl palơq akóón karông; lơq akóón karông palơq nôôq abhưi kamóch ađó tarvei tajơl. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Kơi ađek hayơq ađó kah dyóp praan chróót tarjơl, dham đóng piđó kung kah dyơq bâân lêi dhiq pleng dyơq. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Kơi ađek nek akóón karông gamak bâân m'peq leq katiêk, — akóón kaxênh hanua, bâân đóók nek abhưi bhóch môôiq Sa-taan, đu bhlơp galơơk bhơt hóng katiêk — ađó bâân m'peq leq katiêk, nôôq abhưi kamóch ưng ađó kung bâân m'peq leq katiêk kung palơq ađó. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Hayơq aku xâng mưi dhariêng praaq karơ m'piing pleng, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">“Xók ađôk, rau paq jóói, mataai raman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">lơq katiêk karuung ưng Yaang Pleng nôôq he ơi bhral,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">kung palơq têêng kala ưng Yaang Đơơp Xut Dhơu ưng Ađó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">ơi taai đu kaauq adhi anó ưng nôôq he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nek đu tangêi hayum kaauq piđó toom mat Yaang Pleng nôôq he, ơi bâân m'peq leq katiêk.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Piđó ơi đươk lơh ađó ve ahaam Trưưu Akóón lơq ve paraaq truuih đuui ưng ađêi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">piđó kah châq hiin parhââm mamông ađêi tơk mơ đơơp chêt.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Taai kơơq ađek, phaai yuur bhuui marhaal, nôôq talaang pleng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">palơq nôôq ngaai tơơt mamông dhiq ađek ơơi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">Ayô xarngaat đóng katiêk lơq taxiiq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">taai abhưi bhóch ơi dhaluônh dham nôôq pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">xók dyơq ve ganơt pagrâ tabhlơng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">taai ađó n'nal ađó dyơq m'bưưiq bhlơng tangêi kaxe!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Xók akóón karông bâân n'nal kakơi ađó ơi bâân m'peq leq katiêk, nek ađó ting viêng manưih pađiil parkan, nek manưih ơi n'niên akóón paniên tôôh. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Hayơq bơơr nanang ưng achim kalaang adhuuk gamak bâân đóng leq manưih pađiil parkan ađek đóng ađó par tơk kruung vơng, tơk dham ưng ađêi, dhiq đu ađó bâân gamang lêi dhiq ađek kalóóng mưi ganah, nôôq ganah lơq m'pơng ganah — changaai bhlưa mat akóón kaxênh. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Kơi ađek nek akóón kaxênh próih đơơk gluh tââq kalóóng bóóp ađó kơi paloong karuung ting tapun manưih pađiil parkan, đóng ađó ve chóóm têêng pađiil bâân đơơk tuh palóóng bil. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Hayơq katiêk pơh jóói manưih pađiil parkan, katiêk ahuôq bóóp lơq lâân galuôn parloong karuung đu akóón karông ơi próih pagluh tââq bóóp ađó. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Kơi achêk nek akóón karông yuur pagrâ palơq manưih pađiil parkan hayơq ađó yuur vôôiq kalơng tavaaih tarjơl palơq phơn dyơq lóóiq kalóóng dhong nooi ưng ađó ađek, nek nôôq manưih huuiq jư gani pachóóm ưng Yaang Pleng lơq ve paraaq taruuih ưng Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Hayơq ađó dyương dhiq bhalua xuôr dhiq tóór taxiiq.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Xong tơk, aku lêi mưi panong adhah yuur gluh tââq taxiiq, ve majêt tagê lơq tapól akoq lơq dhiq nôôq tagê ưng ađó nek majêt beq panơơng charnap, hơq m'piing nôôq akoq ưng ađó mưi dhanóók praaq chôlô. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Akóón adhah đu aku lêi nek thê kơi akóón m'bhiêng, tapaang dyung ưng ađó thê kơi ưng jarươm, dyơq bóóp ađó nek thê bóóp sư tư, lơq akóón karông pajaau praan karơ ađêi đóng ađó, kung palơq tanơơt ađêi lơq têêng kala gamak bhlơng. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Mưi kalóóng nôôq akoq ưng ađó kơi ngóq ơi glêh bâân m'bhiiq leng tơk chêt, bơơi dham bhrê ngơn bhlơng ưng ađó ơi bâân payươh. Bhơt katiêk maar driim bhi hơq vôôiq ting akóón adhah, <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />lơq palââng bhuôih kakoh akóón karông taai ađó ơi đóng mataai raman leq akóón adhah, piđó kung bhuôih kakoh akóón adhah, kơi ađô: “Ngaai thê kơi akóón adhah lơq ngaai ve chóóm tarjeng tarvei jaklâk lóóiq ađó đuôh?” <verse eid="REV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Mưi beq bóóp praaq paraaq parlaach lơq praaq chôlô bâân đóng leq akóón adhah, mataai raman kung bâân đóng leq ađó đóng praaq têêng kalóóng puôn jêt bơơr kaxe. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Kơi ađek nek, akóón adhah pơơh bóóp ađó praaq nôôq paraaq tamôôp jơl jaklâk Yaang Pleng, praaq paxê dhanóók Ađó lơq đong bhanuôih pađơ ưng Ađó — nôôq manưih tơơt mamông m'piing pleng. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Akóón adhah bâân pheep tavaaih tarvei palơq nôôq đu huuiq lơq đươk lơh piđó, mataai raman kung bâân đóng leq ađó dhiq dyóp dhong nooi, dhanuôr manưih, dhariêng paraaq lơq katiêk karuung. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Dyóp dhanuôr manưih dhiq katiêk e bhuôih kakoh ađó, nek dhơ dhangaai hơq achak ưng manưih achêk ơi kah bâân xaraq kalóóng Bha-aar Parmông ưng Trưưu Akóón, Yaang ơi bâân taleng, tââq xók tââp tavaaih hóng katiêk. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />La ngaai ve katór, nek phaai xâng.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />La ngaai bâân kóóp đââng katiêk lââng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">manưih ađek alua phaai vôôiq kalơng ađô,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">la ngaai e bâân taleng palơq bhươt kóóih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">manưih ađek phaai bâân taleng palơq bhươt kóóih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 13:10">Ađôk nek rau jarnah đơơp juôn lơq lóóm huuiq ưng nôôq đu huuiq.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi akóón adhah lââng dharơ yuur tââq katiêk, lơq ađó ve bơơr tagê thê kơi akóón trưưu nhuum, hơq ađó praaq têêng kơi akóón karông. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ađó n'dróh vech dyóp mataai raman ưng akóón adhah đu tarnââp toom mat akóón adhah achêk, lơq ađó yuur têêng mataai ađô kơi đóng katiêk palơq dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk e bhuôih kakoh akóón adhah đu tarnââp, nek akóón adhah ve dham bhrê ngơn bhlơng ơi bâân payươh yươh. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ađó yuur têêng nôôq kanal chrih tabhlơng, tơk mơ ađó patơk ve chóóm têêng đóng óih n'toh tââq m'piing pleng leq katiêk dhalam toom mat akóón manưih. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Palơq nôôq kanal chrih đu ađó bâân pheep yuur têêng toom mat akóón adhah, ađó bhlơp galơơk dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk, xók yua dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk têêng a-ô kabhêi akóón adhah ve dham tabhrê palơq bhươt bơơi dyơq mamông. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Ađó bâân pheep đóng parhââm leq a-ô kabhêi ađek ưng akóón adhah, đóng a-ô kabhêi akóón adhah patơk mơ chóóm praaq, lơq têêng ngaai manưih kah bhuôih kakoh a-ô kabhêi akóón adhah phaai bâân taleng chêt. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ađó kung têêng dyóp ngaai, paniên kung kơi taha, karvaan kung kơi ngeeo, rathaai palơq têêng xól, kơi đóng ve chóóm nh'xóóng leq akóón manưih mưi kanal dhiq tapaang têi atươm ưng piđó hamôôiq dhiq maang piđó, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />đóng kah ve dhơ dhangaai ve chóóm kơl môôiq chóóm baan la manưih ađek kah ve kanal achêk, nek achak ưng akóón adhah, hamôôiq sôôq ưng achak ađó. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Rau tabech galang nek ađôk: Ngaai ve rau tarbech n'nal, manưih ađek phaai yaap sôôq ưng akóón adhah. Taai ađó nek sôôq ưng mưi chanak, lơq sôôq ưng ađó nek chapat hariêng chapat jêt chapat.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Hayơq aku chalaang lêi, lơq tôôh, Trưưu Akóón dyương dhiq kakóóng Si-ôôn, lơq kung palơq Ađó nek mưi hariêng puôn jêt puôn ngaan ve dhanóók Ađó lơq dhanóók Ama Ađó bâân xaraq dhiq maang ưng piđó. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Lơq aku xâng dhariêng praaq tââq têêh pleng kơi dhariêng ra-uul ưng bơk jarhu đơơk, kơi dhariêng grơm karơ, lơq dhariêng aku ơi xâng nek thê kơi nôôq manưih chóóm peh tambhreh haak ađêi. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Piđó babóóch mưi guôp bhanóóch tame toom tanơơt lơq toom puôn panong akóón adhah palơq nôôq takóh bhươl, hơq kah ngaai ve chóóm hok n'nal guôp babóóch ađek lơh tââq mưi hariêng puôn jêt puôn ngaan manưih ơi bâân pók kơl tư tââq hóng katiêk. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ađôk nek nôôq manưih kah ơi glêh anhuq palơq pađiil, taai piđó nek nôôq manưih sek se. Ađôk nek nôôq manưih vôôiq ting Trưưu Akóón n'đó leq đu Ađó vôôiq. Nôôq manưih ađô ơi bâân pók tââq m'pơng akóón manưih kơi pale tââp bóóng đóng Yaang Pleng lơq đóng Trưưu Akóón, <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />kah paraaq galơơk chachââr n'đó bâân lêi tââq bóóp piđó, taai piđó kah ve dham dhôôn.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi dhơn pleng lââng par dhiq m'pơng pleng, ve taruuih liêm nh'chró đóng truuih praaq leq dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk — patơk mơ đóng dyóp katiêk karuung, dhong nooi, rau dhariêng lơq dhanuôr manưih — <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />dhaloong karơ dhariêng: “Phaai bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng lơq tapôông cha-iil tabah đóng Ađó. Taai tangêi xêi lơt ưng Ađó ơi tơk. Phaai bhuôih kakoh Yaang têêng tavaaih pleng, katiêk, taxiiq lơq nôôq tóm đơơk.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Mưi chanak lââng, dhơn pleng đu bơơr, tapun hóng, praaq kơi ađô: “Ađó preh hachươp aq, Ba-bi-lôôn gamak ơi preh hachươp, hơq nek đu paxuq chut tabhơt nôôq katiêk ơm tư tââq buôh pagrâ leq rau tapiing taniêt ưng ađó.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Mưi dhơn pleng lââng, chanak đu pe, tapun hóng piđó, praaq karơ dhariêng, kơi ađô: “La ngaai đu bhuôih kakoh akóón adhah palơq a-ô kabhêi ađó, lơq đơơp kanal dhiq maang hamôôiq dhiq têi ađêi, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />hơq manưih ađek kung e ơm buôh pagrâ ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau buôh kah klaai tóóng leq choom grâ jar-ââih ưng Ađó, lơq manưih ađek e bâân chanaaq janah palơq óih lơq lưưu hunh toom mat nôôq dhơn pleng liêm lơq toom mat Trưưu Akóón. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Gayươk tââq dham jarnah achak ưng piđó yuur par patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn, lơq piđó kah ve rau dhêi drơq xók tangêi lơq xók hayum, nek nôôq đu bhuôih kakoh akóón adhah palơq a-ô kabhêi ađó, lơq ngaai đu pei đơơp kanal achak ưng ađó. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ađôk nek rau jarnah xarngaat đơơp jruôn ưng nôôq manưih đu huuiq, nôôq manưih huuiq jư nôôq gani pachóóm ưng Yaang Pleng lơq lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq Jê-su.”<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Aku xâng dhariêng praaq tââq pleng, kơi ađô: “Phaai xaraq: Tââq ađôk leq tabhêêl, phươk đóng manưih chêt nek manưih chêt kalóóng Chuôq.” Yaang Liêm praaq: “Alua, đóng piđó e dhêi drơq tââq nôôq têêng nhưh ưng ađêi, taai nôôq tarnêêng ưng piđó tapun hóng kung palơq piđó.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Hayơq aku chalaang lêi, lơq tôôh, mưi garboq dhaluk bhóók, lơq tơơt dhiq dhaluk nek ngaai ađek thê Akóón Manưih, ve panơơng charnap palơq vaang dhiq akoq Ađó, lơq mưi beq ganat lơp dhiq têi Ađó. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Hayơq mưi dhơn pleng lââng yuur gluh tââq đong bhanuôih, karơ dhariêng dhaloong Yaang dyơq tơơt dhiq dhaluk: “Nhan đóng ganat Amei gluh lơq gat, taai ganah nil đóng gat ơi tơk taai nil aviq dhiq hóng katiêk ơi kriing.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Kơi ađek nek Yaang tơơt dhiq dhaluk havơng ganat Ađó dhiq katiêk, lơq katiêk bâân tagat.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Hayơq mưi dhơn pleng lââng yuur gluh tââq đong bhanuôih m'piing pleng; ađó ađô kung ve mưi beq ganat lơp. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Mưi dhơn pleng lââng dyơq, nek chanak ve têêng mataai m'piing óih, gluh tââq baang bhanuôih, lơq ađó karơ dhariêng dhaloong chanak ve m'beq ganat lơp, kơi ađô: “Phaai pađơơp ganat lơp ađêi gluh lơq gat peh nôôq m'bhô nho tââq nôôq tââm nho dhiq katiêk, taai nôôq m'bhô nho ưng piđó ơi đóm.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Kơi ađek nek chanak dhơn pleng havơng ganat ađêi leq katiêk lơq gat peh bhươn nho dhiq katiêk, hayơq m'peq leq goq galiq nho gamak ưng garnhuh pagrâ ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Goq galiq nho bâân đâq hót nguôi kanóón lơq ahaam kalóóng goq galiq achêk yuur tantoh yaal tơk janoom axeh, yaal mưi ngaan chapat hariêng êt-ta-đơ.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi karnal gamak lơq chrih lââng dhiq pleng: tapól dhơn pleng dyơq jư tapól bhrê hư, nôôq rau xariêq paluch, taai garnhuh pagrâ ưng Yaang Pleng bâân liêm dyóp dhiq piđó.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Aku kung lêi hau rau-riq ađek thê kơi tala palơq xamil tabah bâân xrơu palơq óih. Nôôq đu đươk lơh akóón adhah, lơh a-ô kabhêi ađó, lơq lơh sôôq ưng achak ađó, dyơq dyương dhiq tala xamil tabah, kadhâng tambhreh haak ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Piđó babóóch guôp bhanóóch ưng Môôi-se, dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq guôp bhanóóch ưng Trưưu Akóón, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Kakoh Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang Bhơt Mataai, nôôq tarnêêng Amei alua gamak bhlơng lơq chrih liêm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Kakoh Bhua ưng nôôq dyóp klaang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">kalơng katôôch Amei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">nek bhơt liêm lơq kre dhalam.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Kakoh chuôq, ngaai kah bâân kakhin kapơn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">lơq e kah bhi haanh dhanóók Amei?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Taai chapiên mưi Amei nek tabah liêm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Taai tabhơt nôôq katiêk e vôôiq lơq bhuôih haanh toom mat Amei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">taai nôôq tarnêêng bhơt liêm ưng Amei ơi bâân tapakah.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek, aku chamet lêi, đong bhanuôih ưng pơơq raket bóóp m'piing pleng bâân talóng. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Tapól dhơn pleng kadhâng tapól rau bhrê hư yuur gluh tââq đong bhanuôih, kalóóng chanam palơq bhaai lenh bhóók sek, brương cha-iil, lơq bâân xeet xaneet palơq vaang praang tadhưa. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Hayơq mưi kalóóng puôn panong akóón adhah pađơơp đóng tapól dhơn pleng tapól jahương palơq vaang kađôôq bing rau pagrâ ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang mamông patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Đong bhanuôih puk pui gayươk taai cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng lơq taai mataai raman Ađó, kah ngaai ve chóóm mót kalóóng đong bhanuôih đóng tơk xók tapól rau bhrê hư ưng tapól chanak dhơn pleng bâân xong bhơt.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Hayơq aku xâng mưi dhariêng karơ tââq đong bhanuôih praaq palơq tapól dhơn pleng: “Phaai vôôiq lơq n'toh tapól jahương pagrâ ưng Yaang pleng leq katiêk.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Kơi ađek nek, chanak đu tarnââp vôôiq lơq n'toh jahương ađêi leq katiêk, nek bhih m'peh harek paper lơq têêng ka-ai karuôq avaaih bhral leq akóón manưih, nôôq đu ve karnal ưng akóón adhah, palơq nôôq đu bhuôih kakoh a-ô kabhêi ađó.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Hayơq chanak đu bơơr n'toh jahương ađêi leq taxiiq, nek taxiiq vaaih xar ahaam, kơi ưng manưih chêt, lơq dyóp akóón anaaq mamông kalóóng taxiiq maar chêt.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Hơq tơk chanak đu pe n'toh jahương ađêi leq nôôq karuung atông lơq tóm đơơk, nek piđó vaaih xar ahaam. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Aku xâng dhơn pleng ưng đơơk praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:5">“Kakoh Yaang ađôk ve lơq ơi ve, nek Yaang Liêm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Amei nek Bhơt Liêm taai Amei ơi xêi lơt nôôq tarnêêng ađô.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Taai piđó ơi têêng tantoh ahaam ưng nôôq đu huuiq lơq nôôq đââng taruuih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">hayơq Amei ơi đóng piđó ơm ahaam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:6">Piđó alua đaang bhlơng.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Hayơq aku xâng baang bhanuôih praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:7">“Alua, kakoh Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang Bhơt Mataai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">nôôq rau xêi lơt ưng Amei maar alua dhalam lơq bhơt liêm.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Hayơq chanak đu puôn n'toh jahương ađêi m'piing mat tangêi, nek ađó bâân pheep óch akóón manưih palơq óih. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Kơi ađek nek akóón manưih bâân boh róh taai kuôq puih kah kơi, lơq piđó praaq tamôôp dhanóók ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang ve mataai dhiq nôôq bhrê hư ađô, bơơi piđó kah mơ klôôq lóóm karnóq lơt đóng tapôông cha-iil tabah leq Ađó.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Hayơq chanak đu xââng n'toh jahương ađêi dhiq tanơơt ưng akóón adhah, nek katiêk karuung ađó avaaih xar kanam kanheet, lơq akóón manưih kap n'taak ađêi taai ka-ai karuôq. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Piđó praaq tamôôp Yaang Pleng dhiq pleng taai rau ka-ai karuôq ađêi lơq taai nôôq dham matóch ưng ađêi, kơi ađek bơơi piđó kah dhơ lóóm karnóq lơt leq nôôq tarnêêng ưng ađêi.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Hayơq chanak đu chapat n'toh jahương ađêi leq karuung gamak Ơ-phơ-raat, nek đơơk karuung bâân hariêq góh đóng kalơng ưng nôôq bhua tââq charhóóng mat tangêi blo bâân tadhoon lơơi. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Aku lêi gluh tââq bóóp akóón karông, tââq bóóp akóón adhah, lơq tââq bóóp manưih đââng taruuih chachââr, ve pe yaang anhuq thê kơi adyrum adyrok, <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Taai piđó nek yaang ưng nôôq abhưi yuur têêng bơk karnal chrih, hơq piđó tơk palơq nôôq bhua dhiq plok hóng katiêk đóng kaboq karong piđó đóng ganơt tarjơl mót tangêi gamak ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang bhơt mataai. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />(“Lêi tôôh! Aku bhral kơi đu tatông! Phươk đóng manưih đương meh lơq jư paliêm aau yaal ađêi, đóng ađó yươq jađaang vôôiq lalôh lalut đu akóón manưih chalaang lêi rau đu kachiit ưng ađêi.”) <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Piđó kaboq karong palââng lóóiq dhiq dham bâân đóók nek Ha-ma-gê-đôn kalóóng paraaq Hi-baaq-laai.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Hayơq chanak đu tapól n'toh jahương ađêi mót kalóóng parhââm, nek mưi dhariêng praaq karơ tââq tanơơt kalóóng đong bhanuôih tar-auq gluh, kơi ađô: “Tarnêêng ơi xong!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kơi ađek nek vaaih bhral chaach kamlaaq, dhariêng ka-uôih palơq dhariêng grơm, lơq mưi dharơp dha-ơr katiêk gamak vaaih — dharơp dha-ơr katiêk achêk karơ bhlơng lơq gamak tơk mơ mưi dharơp kơi ađek kah ơi glêh vaaih patââq xók akóón manưih ve mat dhiq katiêk. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Kanóón gamak bâân gluh tablah têêng pe phơn, lơq nôôq kanóón bhươh ưng nôôq katiêk hachươp halơm, lơq Ba-bi-lôôn gamak bâân hei lóóiq toom mat Yaang Pleng đóng pađơơp leq ađó bhiim buôh pagrâ dhuui dhaai ưng Ađó. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Hayơq, dyóp kôông taxiiq maar xooq klôôn, lơq kah rau bâân lêi nôôq kakóóng bôôl. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Nôôq khuk bó dhơl gamak jau mơ mưi ta-lơng tââq pleng n'toh leq m'piing akóón manưih, hayơq palââng praaq tamôôp Yaang pleng tââq bhrê hư bó dhơl, taai bhrê hư ađek alua nek kakhin kapơn bhlơng.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Hayơq mưi kalóóng tapól dhơn pleng kadhâng tapól beq jahương, vôôiq tơk lơq praaq palơq aku kơi ađô: “Vôôiq nô leq, e aku đóng amei lêi rau xêi janah pađiil karơ têêng taniêt tapiing dyơq tơơt dhiq bơk jarhu đơơk, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />hơq kung palơq ađó, nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk ơi têêng lơt taniêt tapiing, dyơq dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk nek ból plơ tââq buôh taniêt tapiing ưng ađó.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Chanak achêk đââng aku vôôiq kalóóng Yaang Liêm tơk mưi kruung vơng, hayơq aku lêi mưi pađiil parkan dhââng dhiq akóón adhah parhóm bhrôông ngót, kađôôq bing nôôq dhanóók đóók praaq chôlô, ve tapól akoq lơq majêt tagê. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Manưih pađiil parkan ađek nek xơp kun aau parhóm pabhrơuq lơq bhrôông ngót, bâân xaraq paliêm palơq vaang, dhơl kiiq, palơq kaliêng ngok, dhiq têi ađó dyơq kadhâng mưi beq bhiim palơq vaang bing nôôq rau harek paper lơq nôôq rau anhuq tââq rau taniêt tapiing ưng ađêi, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />dyơq dhiq maang ađó bâân xaraq mưi dhanóók đóók: “Ba-bi-lôôn lalââp liêm gamak, akan ưng kabhuh têêng taniêt lơq nôôq rau harek paper ưng katiêk.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Hayơq aku lêi manưih pađiil parkan ađek dyơq ból plơ palơq ahaam ưng nôôq đu huuiq lơq palơq ahaam nôôq truuih đuui ưng Chuôq Jê-su, hơq lơh xók bâân lêi ađó ađek, aku hêq lêi palơq yuur chrih lêi kah yakơi. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Chanak dhơn pleng praaq palơq aku: “Taai ng'kơi amei chrih lêi? Aku e móón đóng amei leq rau lalââp ưng pađiil parkan lơq ưng akóón adhah dyơq chơ ađó, nek akóón adhah ve tapól akoq lơq majêt tagê. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Akóón adhah đu amei lêi n'loom ơi ve, xók ađôk kah ve, bơơi val ravang dharơ yuur tââq bóng luôh luông, nek ađó e vôôiq tơk dham chêt bil, hayơq dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk, bơơi achak piđó kah bâân xaraq kalóóng Bha-aar Parmông, tââq xók tââp tavaaih, e chrih lêi bhêêl chalaang lêi akóón adhah taai n'loom ơi ve, xók ađôk kah ve, hayơq e dyơq tơk. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Xók lóóm karnóq ve rau tabech galang kalóóng tarnêêng ađô: Tapól akoq nek tapól kakóóng, dhiq manưih pađiil parkan tôôh tơơt dhiq piđó, lơq piđó nek tapól chanak bhua: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />xââng bhua ơi preh hư, mưi bhua dyơq chaq jơr, mưi bhua lââng biêh kah ơi tơk. Lơq xók ađó tơk, ađó kajuq dhiq tanơơt kalóóng mưi ganah gađóq. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Akóón adhah n'loom ơi ve bơơi xók ađôk kah ve, hơq chênh ađó nek chanak bhua đu takóól; bơơi ađó mađó leq tapól bhua tôôh, lơq dyơq vôôiq tơk dham chêt bil. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Majêt beq tagê đu amei lêi nek majêt bhua, nôôq đu kah ơi bâân đơơp katiêk karuung, bơơi piđó e bâân đơơp kataai têêng bhua kalóóng mưi tangêi kung palơq akóón adhah. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Nôôq bhua ađô ve makơi mưi lóóm karnóq, lơq piđó pađơơp praan karơ palơq têêng kala ưng ađêi đóng akóón adhah. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Piđó e tavaaih tarjơl palơq Trưưu Akóón, hayơq Trưưu Akóón e đươk lơh piđó taai Ađó nek Chuôq ưng nôôq Chuôq, Bhua ưng nôôq bhua — lơq kung palơq Ađó nek nôôq manưih bâân tađaang dhaloong, bâân tachââih, lơq bhơt lóóm.” <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Chanak dhơn pleng praaq palơq aku: “Nôôq jarhu đơơk đu amei lêi, dhiq đu akan têêng taniêt dyơq tơơt, nek nôôq dhanuôr tơơt, nôôq tanóói manưih, nôôq katiêk karuung, lơq nôôq dhariêng paraaq. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Majêt beq tagê đu amei lêi, palơq akóón adhah — piđó e gaam geet akan taniêt tapiing ađek, hayơq piđó e têêng ađó bâân m'bhraq lơơi lơq lalôh lalut, piđó e đah galuôn achak ađó, lơq e boh róh ađó palơq óih, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Taai Yaang Pleng ơi đóng patơơt leq lóóm piđó đóng gluh kanóq kaniêng ưng Ađó đóng yuur têêng mưi kanóq kaniêng, lơq đóng pađơơp katiêk karuung piđó đóng akóón adhah patơk xók nôôq paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng e bâân jaap dhalam bing dyóp. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Manưih pađiil parkan đu amei lêi nek kanóón gamak ve kadhâng akoq dhiq nôôq bhua ưng katiêk.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng ađek aku lêi mưi dhơn pleng lââng dhaluônh tââq pleng, ve mataai raman gamak bhlơng, lơq katiêk bâân tadyóól brương palơq cha-iil tabah ưng ađó achêk. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Palơq dhariêng praaq dyóp grâ karơ, dhơn pleng achêk lalơu karơ, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Ba-bi-lôôn gamak preh hachươp aq!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Ađó ơi xar vaaih dham tơơt jaq ưng nôôq abhưi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">dham kadrêi kađơu ưng dyóp yaang anhuq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">lơq dham kadrêi kađơu ưng dyóp kabhuh achim nhơơp xrơơm, đaang harek paper.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Taai tabhơt nôôq katiêk ơi ból plơ tââq buôh pagrâ leq rau taniêt tapiing ưng ađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk ơi têêng lơt taniêt tapiing palơq ađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">kabhuh buôn baan dhiq katiêk ơi yuur karvaan ve praan karơ dhiq kalơng mamông huông hư ưng ađó.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Hayơq aku xâng mưi dhariêng lââng tââq pleng praaq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Dhanuôr Aku ơơi, phaai gluh tââq ađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">đóng nôôq akóón yươq ting tapâng leq nôôq matu lơt ưng ađó,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">lơq đóng nôôq akóón yươq phaai đơơp dhiq nôôq bhrê hư ưng ađó.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Taai lơt ưng ađó ơi kaboq tagơơn patơk pleng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">lơq Yaang Pleng ơi hei lóóiq nôôq tarnêêng lơt aak ưng ađó.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Phaai xêi palơq ađó kung kơi ađó ơi têêng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">lơq phaai chróót lóóiq lơh tabơơr chu, bơk lơh tabơơr ting nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađó;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">kalóóng bhiim đu ađó ơi tóóng, phaai đóng ađó bơk lơh tabơơr.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ađó ơi tư padyók payaal ađêi lơq mamông ramuôh ng'kơi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">nek phaai đóng ađó rau ka-ai karuôq lơq ranguôq rabaang kơi achêk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Taai ađó praaq kalóóng lóóm ađó, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Aku khe tơơt kơi mưi pađiil bhua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">aku eh rau nek pađiil kamaai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">lơq aku e kah ve mơ tarlum rau nhiim kalau.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Taai kơi ađek, kalóóng mưi tangêi, nôôq bhrê hư ưng ađó e bhral parmat:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">chêt đok, kalau nhiim, ha-ul kró,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">lơq ađó e bâân róh bil palơq óih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">taai Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang praaq xêi ađó, nek Yaang bhơt mataai.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk, nek nôôq đu têêng lơt taniêt tapiing lơq mamông huông hư palơq ađó, e nhiim griit lơq m'bhoonh pabhuk leq ađó bhêêl piđó lêi dya-dyuôl gayươk boh róh ađó, <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />xók dyương tââq changaai taai kakhin kapơn rau jarnah achak ưng ađó, praaq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Ayô xangaat, ayô xangaat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">đóng kanóón gamak Ba-bi-lôôn, kanóón dyóp grâ karơ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Taai kalóóng mưi tangêi, rau xêi janah amei ơi tơk.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Hayơq nôôq buôn baan dhiq katiêk nhiim griit lơq kalau châq đóng ađó, taai kah dyơq ngaai kơl drươp ađô ưng piđó dyơq — <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />đô-drươp palơq vaang, baak, dhơl kiiq, ngok-traai, bhaai lenh ramaanh, bhaai pabhrơuq, bhaai dhoh, bhaai bhrôông ngót, lơq dyóp rau n'lóóng galơu, dyóp đô-parvech palơq bhalưa aruôih, dyóp đô-parvech palơq n'lóóng bhơt kiiq, palơq kóng, palơq bhaxêi, palơq dhơl xariêng, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />palơq kêêq, parluk, dhaak galơu, janươu atang, janươu thum, buôh, nh'xiêng, amun mi ramaanh, aviq mi, tariiq karók, trưưu beeq, axeh lơq xe tarjơl, palơq têêng xól lơq ravaai akóón manưih. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Pale nil hapruôt ưng amei, rau rââm kiêng ưng ravaai, ơi xooq changaai tââq amei, dyóp rau laq lôh parbhôh lơơi lơq kadhok gayór ơi bil tich tââq amei, lơq piđó e kah ve mơ bâân lêi dyơq.” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Nôôq buôn baan ưng nôôq rau đô-drươp ađô, nek nôôq đu ơi xar vaaih karvaan kabhôôq, e dyương róch changaai tââq ađó, nhiim griit, lơq kalau châq taai kakhin rau ka-ai jarnah ưng ađó,<verse eid="REV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:16">“Ayô xangaat, ayô xangaat đóng kanóón gamak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">glêh xơp bhaai lenh ramaanh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">bhaai pabhrơuq, bhaai bhrôông ngót,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">lơq bâân cham parliêm palơq vaang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">dhơl kiiq, ngok-traai,<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />taai kalóóng mưi tangêi, rau karvaan kabhôôq liêm kra kơi ađek bâân hư bil.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Dyóp kala jatau, dyóp tamóói vôôiq jatau tơk leq n'đó điq, nôôq vơq bhuông, palơq dyóp ngaai têêng tarnêêng taxiiq maar dyương tââq changaai,<verse eid="REV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />lơq dhaloong lalơu xók chalaang lêi gayươk boh róh ưng ađó, kơi ađô: “N'đó kanóón kơi kanóón gamak achêk?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Piđó vươk mariêk leq akoq ađêi, lơq dhaloong lalơu, nhiim griit, kalau châq, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“Ayô xangaat, ayô xangaat kanóón gamak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">dhiq đu dyóp ngaai kalóóng ađó ve bhuông jatau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">dhiq taxiiq ơi xar vaaih karvaan kabhôôq ve đô-drươp ađó,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">taai kalóóng mưi tangêi, ađó ơi bâân pahư tabil.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />(“Phaai bhuui marhaal leq ađó, pleng ơơi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">palơq nôôq đu huuiq, sưưq-đô, lơq manưih đââng taruuih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">taai Yaang Pleng ơi xêi lơt rau kaauq móón ưng nôôq pe palơq ađó!”)<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Hayơq mưi dhơn pleng grâ karơ hayôk bhangôh dhơl thê kơi tapal padhiêr gamak lơq m'peq leq taxiiq, praaq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Ting kơi ađô, kanóón gamak Ba-bi-lôôn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">e bâân tampeq karơ chok leq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">lơq e kah ve mơ bâân chalaang lêi dyơq,<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />dhariêng manưih peh tambhreh haak, dhariêng takóq taken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">đu plong aluôt, lơq manưih plong karyóól</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">e kah ve mơ bâân xâng tââq amei dyơq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">dyóp manưih têi ragêi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">e kah ve mơ bâân lêi dhiq amei dyơq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">dhariêng tatap</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">e kah mơ ve bâân xâng tââq amei dyơq,<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />kalaaq brương dhơu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">e kah mơ ve taklaaq dyóól dhiq amei dyơq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">dhariêng chaxaau lơq mamaai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">e kah mơ ve bâân xâng dhiq amei dyơq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">taai nôôq buôn baan ưng amei nek nôôq đu ve kataai karơ dhiq katiêk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">taai dyóp katiêk karuung ơi bâân galơơk chachââr taai raman abhô ưng amei.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ahaam ưng nôôq đââng taruuih palơq nôôq manưih huuiq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">lơq ưng tabhơt nôôq ngaai ơi bâân taleng chêt dhiq katiêk ơi bâân lêi dhiq ađó.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Lơh nôôq tarnêêng achêk, aku xâng dhariêng pakơi dhariêng praaq karơ ưng mưi tanóói manưih bơk bhlơng dhiq pleng, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">Rau paq jóói, cha-iil tabah lơq mataai raman chô leq Yaang Pleng nôôq he,<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />taai nôôq rau xêi lơt ưng Ađó nek alua dhalam lơq bhơt liêm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">tââq Ađó ơi xêi lơt kamór karơ têêng taniêt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">hơq nek đu têêng môôp lơt katiêk palơq keen têêng taniêt ưng ađó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">Chuôq ơi chróót bharang đóng ahaam ưng nôôq dhơn ratơơq Chuôq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">tââq têi kamór ađek.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Hayơq piđó praaq chu đu bơơr, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">Garyươk tââq dham ađó bhiêk yuur par patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Bơơr jêt puôn takóh bhươl lơq puôn panong akóón adhah pađam achak leq katiêk lơq bhuôih kakoh Yaang Pleng, Yaang dyơq jaq dhiq tanơơt, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:4">“A-meen. Ha-lê-lu-ja!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Mưi dhariêng praaq tââq tanơơt yuur praaq, kơi ađô: “Phaai babóóch haanh Yaang Pleng nôôq he, tabhơt nôôq dhơn ratơơq Ađó ơơi, lơq nôôq manưih bhi kakhin Ađó, manưih paniên lơq manưih taha!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Hayơq aku xâng dhariêng praaq pakơi dhariêng xanuul ưng tanóói manưih bơk bhlơng, thê dhariêng ưng bơk jarhu đơơk, lơq thê kơi dhariêng grơm karơ, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">Taai Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng nôôq he, nek Yaang Bhơt Mataai, kadhâng akoq.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Nôôq he phaai bhuui marhaal, yayar tatơq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">lơq tapôông cha-iil tabah leq Ađó</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:7">taai bhiêk đaam ưng Trưưu Akóón ơi tơk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">lơq mamaai ưng Ađó ơi ravang ravưa ađêi xong aq,<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />rau bâân đóng leq ađó ađek nek ađó bâân paxơp panđóh palơq bhaai lenh ramaanh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">brương braang bhóók tabah”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">(taai bhaai lenh ramaanh nek nôôq tarnêêng bhơt liêm ưng nôôq đu huuiq).<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Hayơq dhơn pleng chêk praaq palơq aku: “Phaai xaraq: Phươk đóng leq nôôq manưih bâân kayua tơơt bhiêk đaam Trưưu Akóón.” Chanak achêk kung praaq palơq aku: “Ađôk nek nôôq paraaq lalua dhalam ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Aku chakoh takól dhiq dyung dhơn pleng achêk đóng bhuôih kakoh ađó, bơơi ađó praaq palơq aku: “Óóq têêng kơi ađek! Aku nek manưih kung têêng dhơn ratơơq kơi amei lơq nôôq adhi anó ưng amei, nek nôôq manưih ve paraaq taruuih ưng Chuôq Jê-su. Phaai bhuôih kakoh Yaang Pleng, taai paraaq taruuih ưng Chuôq Jê-su nek lóóm kanóq ưng paraaq manưih đââng taruuih.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Hayơq aku lêi pleng yuur tarlóng, lơq lêi tôôh, mưi panong axeh bhóók, lơq Yaang dhââng dhiq ađó bâân đóók nek kah tadhơ lơq lalua dhalam, Ađó praaq xêi tarvei tarjơl ting paraaq bhơt liêm. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mat Ađó kơi par-aang óih, bơk panơơng charnap m'piing akoq Ađó, ve mưi dhanóók bâân xaraq bơơi kah ngaai n'nal lơh tââq chênh Ađó. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ađó xơp mưi aau chaguôk tươm kalóóng ahaam, lơq dhanóók Ađó bâân đóók nek Paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Nôôq kabhuh linh m'piing pleng ting vôôiq Ađó dhiq axeh bhóók, xơp bhaai lenh ramaanh bhóók lơq sek tabah. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mưi pala bhươt xaan lơp yuur gluh tââq bóóp Ađó, đóng palơq ađó Chuôq tarjơl nôôq katiêk, hayơq Ađó e kadhâng akoq piđó palơq mandreh tarlââng bhaxêi, lơq Ađó đâq goq galiq buôh kađôôq ganhuh pagrâ janah dhuui dhaai ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang Bhơt Mataai. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ađó ve mưi dhanóók achak bâân xaraq dhiq aau chaguôk lơq dhiq malau Ađó: “Bhua ưng nôôq bhua, lơq Chuôq ưng nôôq chuôq.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi dhơn pleng dyương kalóóng mat tangêi, lơq ađó achêk yuur dhaloong palơq mưi dhariêng karơ, kung tabhơt nôôq m'ma achim dyơq par m'piing pleng, kơi ađô: “Vôôiq leq ađô, phaai kaboq karong đóng vaar bhiêk gamak ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />đóng đah adhah nôôq bhua, adhah nôôq kuôn gamak, achak nôôq đu grâ karơ, adhah kabhuh axeh lơq linh dhââng dhiq piđó, kung palơq adhah ưng dyóp ngaai, kah rathaai lơq têêng xól, bhơt paniên lơq taha.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Hayơq tơk, aku lêi akóón adhah lơq nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk palơq kabhuh linh ưng piđó bâân nhoom karong lóóiq đóng tavaaih tarjơl palơq Yaang dhââng hóng axeh lơq palơq kabhuh linh ưng Ađó. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Hayơq akóón adhah bâân takóóp, kung palơq ađó nek đââng taruuih chachââr, đu yuur têêng toom mat ađó nôôq kanal chrih, ve ađek hơq ađó bhlơp galơơk nôôq đu ơi đơơp kanal ưng akóón adhah lơq nôôq đu bhuôih kakoh a-ô kabhêi ađó. Miq bơơr xók dyơq mamông bâân m'peq leq bóng óih bâân óch róh palơq lưưu hunh. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Phơn dyơq lóóiq kalóóng kabhuh piđó hơq bâân taleng chêt palơq pla bhươt ưng Yaang dhââng hóng axeh, nek pla bhươt gluh tââq bóóp Ađó, lơq tabhơt achim brih bâân kabhôôq kajrê tââq adhah kabhuh piđó.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Hayơq aku lêi mưi dhơn pleng dharơ dhaluônh tââq pleng, kadhâng kaliêng kliêng ưng bóng luôh luông lơq mưi tarlêi xiêng gamak kalóóng têi ađêi. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ađó pei kóóp akóón karông, nek akóón kaxênh hanua, hơq ađek nek abhưi, môôiq Sa-taan, hayơq kađaai ađó lóóiq kalóóng mưi ngaan kamó. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Dhơn pleng m'peq ađó mót bóng luôh luông, hayơq kađơp lơq let kiêr dhiq ađó, đóng ađó kah dyơq galơơk chachââr nôôq katiêk dyơq patơk xók mưi ngaan kamó bâân xong bhơt. Xong ađek, ađó phaai bâân yuur paloh kalóóng mưi ganah gađóq.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Hayơq aku lêi nôôq tanơơt, palơq nôôq manưih tơơt dhiq ađek, lơq mataai praaq xêi ơi bâân đóng leq piđó, palơq ravaai ưng nôôq manưih ơi bâân gôh tuôr taai truuih đuui ưng Chuôq Jê-su lơq taai paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq ưng tabhơt nôôq ngaai kah bhuôih kakoh akóón adhah môôiq a-ô kabhêi ađó, kung kah đơơp kanal ưng ađó dhiq maang môôiq dhiq têi ađêi, piđó mamông lóóiq lơq kadhâng akoq kung palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih kalóóng mưi ngaan kamó. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Sôôq dyơq lóóiq kalóóng nôôq manưih chêt nek kah mamông lóóiq patơk xók luch bhơt mưi ngaan kamó.) Ađek nek rau mamông lóóiq đu tarnââp. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Phươk liêm lơq tabah liêm đóng ngaai manưih ve phơn kalóóng rau mamông lóóiq đu tarnââp! Akan chêt đu bơơr kah ve rau kataai dhiq nôôq manưih achêk, bơơi piđó e nek takóh bhanuôih ưng Yaang pleng lơq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq e palơq Ađó kadhâng akoq kalóóng mưi ngaan kamó.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Hayơq xók mưi ngaan kamó bâân xong bhơt, Sa-taan e bâân paloh tââq karól ưng ađó, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Hayơq ađó e vôôiq gluh blơp chachââr nôôq katiêk tơơt puôn charhóóng dhiq katiêk, dhanuôr Goot lơq dhanuôr Ma-goot, đóng karong maleq piđó lóóiq đóng tarvei tajơl. Sôôq linh ưng piđó pakơi xuôr taxiiq. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Piđó pajươk đơk plok dyóp leq dhiq katiêk lơq xavaang đong jơơng ưng nôôq manưih huuiq palơq kanóón bơk nh'nhơr, hayơq óih dhuônh tââq pleng lơq boh róh piđó. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Hayơq abhưi, đu dharơơl galơơk piđó, bâân m'peq leq bóng óih lơq lưưu hunh, đu akóón adhah palơq manưih đââng taruuih chachââr tơơt dhiq kalóóng ađek, lơq piđó e bâân jarnah achak tangêi lơq hayum patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Xong ađek aku lêi mưi tanơơt bhóók gamak lơq Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt, katiêk lơq pleng klôôn xooq tââq rau ve mat ưng Ađó, bơơi kah n'đó dhiq bâân koom đóng piđó. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Hayơq aku lêi nôôq đu chêt, bhơt taha lơq paniên, dyương toom tanơơt, lơq nôôq bha-aar bâân talương, hayơq mưi bha-aar lââng bâân talương, ađek nek Bha-aar Parmông. Đu chêt bâân xêi lơt ting nôôq rau bâân xaraq lóóiq kalóóng nôôq bha-aar achêk, ting mơ nôôq tarnêêng ưng piđó. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Taxiiq đââng pajaau nôôq đu chêt kalóóng taxiiq, akan chêt lơq maraaih pajaau đââng nôôq đu chêt dhiq piđó, lơq ting chanak manưih bâân xêi ting lơt mơ nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Hayơq akan chêt lơq maraaih bâân m'peq leq bóng óih. Ađôk nek akan chêt đu bơơr, nek bóng óih. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />La ngaai đu bâân chamet lêi kah bâân xaraq kalóóng Bha-aar Parmông, hơq ađó ađek bâân tampeq leq bóng óih.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Xong ađek, aku lêi pleng tame lơq katiêk tame, taai pleng đu tarnââp lơq katiêk đu tarnââp ơi lơh aq; hơq taxiiq nek kah vaaih dyơq. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Hayơq aku lêi kanóón tabah liêm, nek Jê-ru-sa-leem tame, dhaluônh patââq Yaang Pleng m'piing pleng, bâân ravang ravưa kơi mưi panong mamaai cham dhiik, đóng leq kayiik ađêi. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Aku xâng mưi dhariêng praaq karơ tââq tanơơt, kơi ađô: “Lêi tôôh! Pơơq pađơ ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt palơq akóón manưih, lơq Ađó e mamông palơq piđó, lơq piđó e nek dhanuôr Ađó, lơq chênh Yaang Pleng e tơơt palơq piđó. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Ađó e dyuut bhơt đơơk mat tââq mat piđó, lơq akan chêt e kah vaaih dyơq, kung kah dyơq ranguôq rabaang, môôiq nhiim griit, hamôôiq ka-ai karuôq. Piđó e kah vaaih dyơq; taai nôôq tarnêêng laloom tââm ơi lơh aq.” <verse eid="REV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Hayơq Yaang tơơt dhiq tanơơt praaq: “Lêi tôôh! Aku têêng tame dyóp rau.” Ađó kung praaq palơq aku: “Phaai xaraq lóóiq taai nôôq paraaq ađô nek đaang huuiq lơq alua dhalam.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Ađó kung kayua aku: “Nôôq tarnêêng achêk ơi xong! Aku nek An-pha lơq Ô-mê-ga, nek tââq tarnââp lơq tatun xariêq. Ngaai đu rahaal, Aku e đóng ơm kagóh tââq tóm đơơk parmông. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ngaai đu đươk e bâân đươi nôôq rau ađô, lơq Aku e nek Yaang Pleng ưng ađó, dyơq ađó e nek akóón Aku. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Bơơi leq phơn nôôq đu ngôôk dyââng, đu kah ve lóóm huuiq, đu đaang harek paper, đu leng manưih, đu têêng taniêt, đu têêng tarnêêng gun raman, đu bhuôih a-ô kabhêi, palơq dyóp nôôq đu praaq chachââr, hơq dham ưng piđó nek kalóóng bóng bâân óch róh palơq óih lơq lưưu hunh, hơq ađek nek akan chêt đu bơơr.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Hayơq mưi kalóóng tapól dhơn pleng bhral, nek tââq nôôq đu ve tapól jahương kađôôq bing tapól bhrê hư tatun xariêq, lơq dhơn pleng achêk praaq palơq aku, kơi ađô: “Phaai vôôiq leq ađô, aku e đóng amei lêi mamaai, kađiêl ưng Trưưu Akóón.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Xong ađek, ađó đââng aku vôôiq kalóóng Yaang Liêm tơk mưi bhung kakóóng gamak lơq yaal, hayơq chaleq đóng aku kanóón tabah liêm Jê-ru-sa-leem dhaluônh jaq patââq Yaang Pleng dhiq pleng, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />ve cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng, bleh blơp ưng kanóón makơi kaliêng dhơl kiiq, kơi ngok dhơl bhóók chadhah pakơi pha-lê, <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />pâng đươi kariing dhơl gamak lơq yaal, ve majêt bơơr palóng kariing palơq majêt bơơr dhơn pleng dhiq nôôq palóng, lơq nôôq achak bâân xaraq dhiq palóng, hơq ađek nek achak majêt bơơr kabhuh ưng nôôq akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Pe palóng kariing tơơt hót mat blo, pe palóng kariing tơơt hót lóóm, pe palóng kariing tơơt hót hóng, lơq pe palóng kariing tơơt hót mat blót. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Kariing dhơl kanóón ve majêt bơơr beq bhanơn, dhiq ađek nek majêt bơơr achak majêt bơơr sưưq-đô ưng Trưưu Akóón. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Chanak dhơn pleng dyơq praaq palơq aku ve mưi n'dreh dhanang đang palơq vaang đóng ađó ve chóóm đang kanóón, nôôq palóng kariing kanóón lơq kariing dhơl kanóón. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Kanóón bâân kanóq têêng dhaau phaaq; paryaal kagan ưng kanóón marđơq parbhươh ưng kanóón. Dhơn pleng achêk đang kanóón palơq n'dreh dhanang, đuôh majêt bơơr ngaan êt-ta-đơ: paryaal kagan, parbhươh lơq paryaal tadhơng ưng kanóón nek marmơ. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ađó kung đang kariing dhơl kanóón, kâng mưi hariêng puôn jêt puôn ku-đê ting dhanang đang ưng akóón manưih (bơơi kung nek ưng dhơn pleng). <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Parmaam têêng ưng kariing kanóón nek ngok bhóók chadhah, dyơq kanóón bhươh nek palơq vaang ngaq, kơi xamil tabah bhóók cha-iil. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Nôôq bhlaang ưng kariing dhơl kanóón bâân paliêm parcham palơq dyóp rau dhơl kiiq. Bhlaang tarnââp nek ngok bhóók chadhah, đu bơơr nek ngok taviêng, đu pe nek ngok manaau, đu puôn nek ngok taviêng ngót, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />đu xââng nek bhrôông manaau, đu chapat nek dhơl taviêng bleh blơp, đu tapól nek ngok taviêng viêng, đu takóól nek ngok lakgal, đu takiêh nek ngok bhrôông bhangơm, đu majêt nek ngok taviêng ngót, đu majêt muui nek ngok bhrôông ngót, đu majêt bơơr nek ngok bhrôông bhrơuq. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Majêt bơơr palóng kariing nek majêt bơơr kaliêng ahiêt; palơq dyóp ađó palóng kariing nek vaaih xar tââq mưi kaliêng hiêt i kơi ađek, dyơq kalơng bhươh kalóóng kanóón palơq vaang ngaq, thê xamil tabah bhóók chadhah. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Aku kah lêi ve n'đó đong bhanuôih kalóóng kanóón, taai Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng, Yaang Bhơt Mataai palơq Trưưu Akóón nek đong bhanuôih ưng kanóón. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Kanóón kah đươi ve mat tangêi môôiq mat bharương đóng dyóól brương leq kanóón, taai cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng dyóól brương kanóón, dyơq par-aang dhơu ưng kanóón nek Trưưu Akóón. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Nôôq dhanuôr e vôôiq val ve taklaaq brương ưng kanóón ađek, lơq nôôq bhua dhiq katiêk đââng cha-iil tabah ađêi mót leq ađek. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Bhluuch tangêi, nôôq palóng kariing kanóón kah ve mơ bâân kađơp, taai kah ve bhêêl kanam dhiq ađek. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Akóón manưih e đââng cha-iil tabah lơq rau bhi chap ưng nôôq katiêk mót leq ađek, <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />bơơi rau đu anhuq môôiq đu têêng tarnêêng đaang harek paper lơq dharơơl galơơk e kah ve mơ mót kalóóng kanóón, lơh tââq nôôq ngaai bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar parmông ưng Trưưu Akóón.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Xong ađek, dhơn pleng achêk chaleq đóng aku karuung đơơk parmông, bleh blơp kơi pha-lê, hóói gluh tââq tanơơt ưng Yaang Pleng lơq ưng Trưưu Akóón, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />dhiq pa-ô m'pơng kalơng bhươh ưng kanóón. Phơn hót ađô lơq hót tôôh ưng karuung nek n'lóóng parmông đóng gluh majêt bơơr rau pale, vaaih cheeh gluh pale ưng n'lóóng mak mơ ting kaxe, dyơq axơq ưng n'lóóng koom leq tarnêêng payươh ka-ai ưng nôôq katiêk. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />E kah dyơq rau tóh đua n'đó dyơq, lơq tanơơt ưng Yaang Pleng lơq ưng Trưưu Akóón e tơơt kalóóng kanóón, dyơq nôôq dhơn ratơơq Ađó e têêng yaauq Ađó. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Piđó e lêi mat Ađó, lơq dhanóók Ađó tơơt dhiq maang piđó. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />E kah vaaih hayum dyơq, akóón manưih kah ve kiêng đươi leq taklaaq dhơu môôiq taklaaq mat tangêi, taai Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng e dyóól brương dhiq piđó, lơq piđó e kadhâng akoq patơk nh'chró, taluôn luôn.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Hayơq dhơn pleng achêk praaq palơq aku: “Nôôq paraaq ađô nek đaang huuiq lơq lalua dhalam. Chuôq, nek Yaang Pleng ưng lóóm karnóq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, ơi kayua dhơn pleng Ađó pakah đóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq Ađó nôôq tarnêêng phaai vaaih tơk kơi đâh dyaq.” <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Lêi tôôh! Aku dyơq bhral kơi đâh bhlơng! Phươk đóng manưih huuiq jư nôôq paraaq manưih đââng taruuih ưng bha-aar ađô.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Aku, nek Jang, kung nek manưih lêi lơq xâng nôôq tarnêêng ađô. Xók aku ơi xâng lơq lêi, aku pađam achak leq katiêk đóng bhuôih kakoh dhalam dyung ưng dhơn pleng, nek đu pakah đóng aku nôôq tarnêêng achêk. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Hayơq dhơn pleng achêk praaq palơq aku: “Óóq têêng kơi ađek! Aku nek manưih markơi têêng dhơn ratơơq palơq amei, lơq palơq nôôq adhi anó ưng amei, nek nôôq đââng taruuih, palơq nôôq ngaai huuiq jư nôôq paraaq ưng bha-aar ađô. Phaai bhuôih kakoh Yaang Pleng!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Hayơq ađó yua aku: “Óóq let kiêr nôôq paraaq taruuih ưng bha-aar ađô, taai ganah dyơq tơơt đan aq. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Đu kah liêm, phaai bhiêk kah liêm. Đu anhuq, phaai bhiêk anhuq. Manưih bhơt liêm, phaai bhiêk têêng rau bhơt liêm. Ngaai sek tabah, phaai bhiêk bâân tavaaih liêm.” <verse eid="REV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Lêi tôôh! Aku dyơq bhral kơi đâh bhlơng, lơq phơn chaner ưng Aku ting vôôiq palơq Aku, đóng chróót leq dyóp ngaai kơi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng manưih ađek nek ng'kơi. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Aku nek An-pha lơq Ô-mê-ga, nek tââq tarnââp lơq tatun xariêq, nek tââp vaaih lơq gluui parluch. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Phươk đóng nôôq manưih pươh aau yaal ađêi đóng piđó e bâân khin tơk n'lóóng parmông, lơq vôôiq lơh nôôq palóng kariing mót kalóóng kanóón. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Hót nguôi kanóón nek kabhuh anuq, kabhuh têêng gun raman, đu têêng taniêt, đu leng manưih, đu bhuôih a-ô kabhêi, palơq dyóp manưih kiêng marlóóch lơq têêng rau galơơk chachââr.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Aku, nek Jê-su, ơi kayua dhơn pleng ưng Aku đóng truuih taruuih leq akóón nôôq tarnêêng achêk palơq nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq. Aku nek tââm tu lơq akóón chachau ưng Đa-viit, nek charo yayóng brương cha-iil.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Yaang Liêm lơq MaMaai praaq: “Phaai tơk!” Ngaai xâng, kung phaai praaq: “Phaai tơk!” Ngaai rahaal, phaai tơk. Ngaai kiêng, phaai pei đơơp đơơk parmông đóng kagóh.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Aku truuih đuui đóng dyóp ngaai xâng nôôq paraaq manưih đââng taruuih ưng bha-aar ađô, kơi ađô: La ngaai trul leq piđó, nek Yaang Pleng e trul leq manưih ađek nôôq bhrê hư bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar ađô. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />La ngaai kut heek tââq nôôq paraaq ưng bha-aar manưih đââng taruuih ađô hayơq Yaang Pleng e tabil phơn ưng manưih ađek tââq n'lóóng parmông lơq kalóóng kanóón tabah liêm bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar ađô.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yaang têêng truuih nôôq tarnêêng ađô praaq: “Alua! Aku dyơq bhral kơi đâh bhlơng.” A-meen! Kakoh Chuôq Jê-su, nhan phaai bhral!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq Jê-su tơơt palơq nôôq manưih huuiq. A-meen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>